  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Codex Piscium"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Codex Piscium"
   },
   "Key": "15317A7345E6ED4B13993CB62708385D"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "It's pretty usefull to be able to craft your own Codex Piscium, especially if you lost yours... be more carefull with your stuff please..."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "It's pretty usefull to be able to craft your own Codex Piscium, especially if you lost yours... be more carefull with your stuff please..."
   },
   "Key": "5B0EDF6942130768E79F8D9C943C57F1"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Minnow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Minnow"
   },
   "Key": "A4E4774E4BB69722C51BDE9E93CA6303"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A tiny, darting fish. Common but useful as bait."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A tiny, darting fish. Common but useful as bait."
   },
   "Key": "21E0345944ECFABF7791BFB3B9C8AF41"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A field journal where every catch leaves its mark: a hasty sketch, a measurement in cm, the biome and the period of the encounter. Far to the east, in the islands of Yamatai, scholars call such a tome a 'Piscidex'. The name has yet to take root among the exiles, but the practice is the same. Inscribed on the first page in faded ink: \"Catch them all.\""
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A field journal where every catch leaves its mark: a hasty sketch, a measurement in cm, the biome and the period of the encounter. Far to the east, in the islands of Yamatai, scholars call such a tome a 'Piscidex'. The name has yet to take root among the exiles, but the practice is the same. Inscribed on the first page in faded ink: \"Catch them all.\""
   },
   "Key": "12BDF89F4B8E0D1C4622E6A4AC5006FD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ratchet Crank"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ratchet Crank"
   },
   "Key": "4CE3A0904ACB3825E7D1D897C393F837"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Unlocks fish fatigue while reeling"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Unlocks fish fatigue while reeling"
   },
   "Key": "EC660E01482B37B3E113C0A5F31FFB97"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A geared bronze crank whose ratchet bites down on every turn, holding each hard-won length of line so none slips back. Fitted to your reel and kept in your pack, it lets you wear a thrashing fish to exhaustion the great and legendary catches that once snapped taut lines and vanished can at last be brought to shore."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A geared bronze crank whose ratchet bites down on every turn, holding each hard-won length of line so none slips back. Fitted to your reel and kept in your pack, it lets you wear a thrashing fish to exhaustion the great and legendary catches that once snapped taut lines and vanished can at last be brought to shore."
   },
   "Key": "BF69B06143B689DBF7909DB19BF861FF"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Codex Piscium"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Codex Piscium"
   },
   "Key": "FF3D557540B385BF97094493A959B84C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A leather-bound journal that records every fish you have caught."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A leather-bound journal that records every fish you have caught."
   },
   "Key": "E9AEABF542A476236EAD459F860847CA"
  },
