  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fish Meal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Fish Meal"
   },
   "Key": "30E3D8074AA044FAF771D3BE41BF99C9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fisher"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Fisher"
   },
   "Key": "8DD9D41B4938E05B113F0285D80868ED"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The rivers and lakes of the Exiled Lands offer sustenance to those willing to wait. A rod, some bait, and the right spot are all an exile needs."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The rivers and lakes of the Exiled Lands offer sustenance to those willing to wait. A rod, some bait, and the right spot are all an exile needs."
   },
   "Key": "3693ECAC40218890478CF7A3721E2BFD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Craft a Fishing Rod"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Craft a Fishing Rod"
   },
   "Key": "F416109442CD8E11C356C39E574C6A98"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Open your inventory and craft a Fishing Rod from the crafting menu. <br><br>It requires only basic materials and no crafting station."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Open your inventory and craft a Fishing Rod from the crafting menu. <br><br>It requires only basic materials and no crafting station."
   },
   "Key": "D6E3E0BC4C0F1E39DBCD0B86AC9875F6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Craft an Insect Bait"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Craft an Insect Bait"
   },
   "Key": "4248F4D24D734417CD5571AEB3A4C1DE"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bait is required to fish. Open your inventory and craft some bait from the handcrafting menu. <br><br>Once crafted, equip your fishing rod and load the bait onto it the same way you would load arrows onto a bow."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Bait is required to fish. Open your inventory and craft some bait from the handcrafting menu. <br><br>Once crafted, equip your fishing rod and load the bait onto it the same way you would load arrows onto a bow."
   },
   "Key": "A847B2674FF7ED2303D708A6827928ED"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Catch a Fish"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Catch a Fish"
   },
   "Key": "FDBD97FB4524B1F7F8BCAD8532016503"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Equip your fishing rod and approach any body of water. Use Start Fishing in your emotes radial menu (default: R) to cast your line, then wait for a fish to bite. <br><br>When the mini-game starts, keep the fish inside the capture zone until the progress bar fills to reel it in. (Press LMB to go up, release to go down)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Equip your fishing rod and approach any body of water. Use Start Fishing in your emotes radial menu (default: R) to cast your line, then wait for a fish to bite. <br><br>When the mini-game starts, keep the fish inside the capture zone until the progress bar fills to reel it in. (Press LMB to go up, release to go down)"
   },
   "Key": "997CFE404B9D829C722D9A943BC07BA9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cook a Fish Fillet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cook a Fish Fillet"
   },
   "Key": "4F7F5C194C312FD6743BE8856B80DCC3"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Caught fish can be processed into fillets at the Stove. Fillets are used as ingredients to craft higher-tier fishing equipment and bait. <br><br>Different fish yield different fillets depending on their biome and tier."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Caught fish can be processed into fillets at the Stove. Fillets are used as ingredients to craft higher-tier fishing equipment and bait. <br><br>Different fish yield different fillets depending on their biome and tier."
   },
   "Key": "8AA7374741352F1531ED188CE4308C06"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Craft a piece of Fisher's Equipment"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Craft a piece of Fisher's Equipment"
   },
   "Key": "DB2BFF7C4DDA3FC4B8484081F2A06788"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fisher's equipment is crafted at the Armorer's Bench. Each piece increases your Fishing Power, which improves your odds of catching rarer fish and reduces the time between bites. <br><br>Fisher's equipment occupies your armor slots."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Fisher's equipment is crafted at the Armorer's Bench. Each piece increases your Fishing Power, which improves your odds of catching rarer fish and reduces the time between bites. <br><br>Fisher's equipment occupies your armor slots."
   },
   "Key": "A4EF09894E204FB8C899DA8B33B8766B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Craft a Fishing Accessory"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Craft a Fishing Accessory"
   },
   "Key": "DA85258B4D1888A53A4213AEC6BD7A73"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fishing accessories are crafted at the Tinker's Bench. They provide passive bonuses while fishing and do not need to be equipped, simply keep them in your inventory. <br><br>Only one of each accessory is counted. Carrying duplicates provides no additional benefit."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Fishing accessories are crafted at the Tinker's Bench. They provide passive bonuses while fishing and do not need to be equipped, simply keep them in your inventory. <br><br>Only one of each accessory is counted. Carrying duplicates provides no additional benefit."
   },
   "Key": "9A90523648F8DCE7BA9688BA66F9DFED"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You don't have bait."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "You don't have bait."
   },
   "Key": "DA90DFA84F936A136857DD95B17C95E1"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You don't have a fishing rod."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "You don't have a fishing rod."
   },
   "Key": "CAEE21654417B7FED61012981F4195B9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "There is no water to fish."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "There is no water to fish."
   },
   "Key": "392E11954A4FD01F72F76B89F00B1252"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You already fishing."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "You already fishing."
   },
   "Key": "036AA3A14FEDFA954440AFAA897EF226"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Start Fishing"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Start Fishing"
   },
   "Key": "7A521084474B607EBD0247900C3049D6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Press \"R\" again to quit fishing."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Press \"R\" again to quit fishing."
   },
   "Key": "B63E106B496A1450E418E49E8935BCAA"
  },
