   },
   "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet of fire and spice. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet of fire and spice. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This banquet is built around fish cooked in fierce oils and red desert heat. The first breath over it stings the eyes; the first bite reminds exiles why they still live."
   },
