   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A noble portion from clean current."
   },
   "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Selected from the finest river catch, this portion is cooked gently and dressed with clear herbs. Even in exile, some meals remember the table manners of kings."
