   "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Laid for a full camp, this feast follows the old river custom: first portion to the blade, second to the hand that rows, third to the one who keeps watch."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Laid for a full camp, this feast follows the old river custom: first portion to the blade, second to the hand that rows, third to the one who keeps watch."
