    "Text": "Blighted Axe"
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344605_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A wicked looking battle axe shaped from the pelvic bone of a demon from the hells.  "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A wicked looking battle axe shaped from the pelvic bone of a demon from the hells.  "
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344605_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural resilience and emanates a disconcerting feeling.\n\nBattle axes are a difficult weapon for inexperienced warriors, due to their smaller surface area and uneven balance. No other one-handed weapon shares their raw power, and they can wreak havoc on unarmored foes."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural resilience and emanates a disconcerting feeling.\n\nBattle axes are a difficult weapon for inexperienced warriors, due to their smaller surface area and uneven balance. No other one-handed weapon shares their raw power, and they can wreak havoc on unarmored foes."
   },
