    "Text": "Blighted Dual Axes"
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344606_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wicked looking battle axes, balanced for dual wielding."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Wicked looking battle axes, balanced for dual wielding."
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344606_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural resilience and emanates a disconcerting feeling.These axes have been perfectly balanced for the purpose of wielding both of them at the same time, sacrificing defense in favor of a flurry of blows being rained down on your opponent."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural resilience and emanates a disconcerting feeling.These axes have been perfectly balanced for the purpose of wielding both of them at the same time, sacrificing defense in favor of a flurry of blows being rained down on your opponent."
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344606_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Shieldsmash"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Shieldsmash"
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344606_FirstModifier"
  },
