   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344608_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A wicked looking two-handed sword shaped from the spine of a demon from the hells.  "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A wicked looking two-handed sword shaped from the spine of a demon from the hells.  "
   },
   "Key": "DT_NightTerrors_ItemTable_101344608_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Forged in the blistering heat of the hells and infused with the essence and remains of demons, this weapon has an unnatural resilience and emanates a disconcerting feeling.\n\nGreat swords are faster than many other two-handed weapons, and their great reach makes them ideal for fending off groups of opponents."
   },
   "Translation": {
