   },
   "Key": "75F76CCB49192C7019D2B0BE82739AB6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Key": "AD541B864DA4BA572F0970AC093C8C99"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "We were attacked and chased in here by something lurking in the darkness. I have been severely wounded and cannot continue. The rest of the group continued deeper into the caverns. They said they would send help once a way out is found, but I think I have been left for dead. I've heard there are great riches to be found here. Although, I didn't realize how much of a fight it would be to get to them. There are rumors of caverns going off in all directions. The old wanderer we spoke with told us to only travel northward through the caves. There is something unholy about this place. Darkness surrounds it, binds it, consumes it...Beware anyone who finds this journal, do not continue, turn back while you still can. These may be my last words."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "We were attacked and chased in here by something lurking in the darkness. I have been severely wounded and cannot continue. The rest of the group continued deeper into the caverns. They said they would send help once a way out is found, but I think I have been left for dead. I've heard there are great riches to be found here. Although, I didn't realize how much of a fight it would be to get to them. There are rumors of caverns going off in all directions. The old wanderer we spoke with told us to only travel northward through the caves. There is something unholy about this place. Darkness surrounds it, binds it, consumes it...Beware anyone who finds this journal, do not continue, turn back while you still can. These may be my last words."
   },
   "Key": "4589E8014650CC9225D425BB86CA6E22"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Key": "A0AAF6634CA07B0FAA8D64ADEB7F8313"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The crates have been stuffed full of resources from the caverns below. We are now just waiting for the caravan from the west to arrive. The gentle were-hyena outside keeps watch for us and speaks of strange things to passersby. Some of the group have ventured further into the caverns to seek out more riches even though we heard strange things the in darkness. It has been a while since they left, and we are unsure of their fate. I appreciate my life too much and dare not venture after them! I will leave as soon as the caravan arrives."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The crates have been stuffed full of resources from the caverns below. We are now just waiting for the caravan from the west to arrive. The gentle were-hyena outside keeps watch for us and speaks of strange things to passersby. Some of the group have ventured further into the caverns to seek out more riches even though we heard strange things the in darkness. It has been a while since they left, and we are unsure of their fate. I appreciate my life too much and dare not venture after them! I will leave as soon as the caravan arrives."
   },
   "Key": "17A7AEEB4ED5F684C20631B6293C3B9E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cavern Explorer Journal"
   },
   "Key": "0C77DF654E0DBF42AC7F599CAD1700AB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Gods curse this damn door! It's stuck again! We have supplies just on the other side to take up for the caravan. We've sent a group to find another way into the room just beyond. We keep hearing strange things, the walls seem to whisper, and the darkness grows all around us. Even our torches aren't very good!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Gods curse this damn door! It's stuck again! We have supplies just on the other side to take up for the caravan. We've sent a group to find another way into the room just beyond. We keep hearing strange things, the walls seem to whisper, and the darkness grows all around us. Even our torches aren't very good!"
   },
   "Key": "CB8DB48B436F1F6240A6CEBC431BA3A9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The drillers have breached this area through bricked up and sealed walls. The foreman told everyone to just go through it to get to the next area, but this place was built for something - maybe to hold something? It looks like a tomb and we can hear something in the distance..."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The drillers have breached this area through bricked up and sealed walls. The foreman told everyone to just go through it to get to the next area, but this place was built for something - maybe to hold something? It looks like a tomb and we can hear something in the distance..."
   },
   "Key": "5F323FCB4E57762C97FE719F0CC8F620"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Everyone is changing; transforming. The more we linger here, the stranger I feel. We are cursed for digging so deep. Our greed has doomed us."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Everyone is changing; transforming. The more we linger here, the stranger I feel. We are cursed for digging so deep. Our greed has doomed us."
   },
   "Key": "B38D7DC7424CA0A1A02BABBC235B9E43"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "What the hell did we run into? It looks like an old mine shaft. I wonder if there is any loot worth looking for here?"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "What the hell did we run into? It looks like an old mine shaft. I wonder if there is any loot worth looking for here?"
   },
   "Key": "19DD180E4D8B435BDCB94ABA13EA4412"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "We barely made it through that fight. I didn't realize that door behind the archivist would lead us here. This place seems ancient. Where does this all lead and what is that thing with the glowing eyes?! Oh, crap..."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "We barely made it through that fight. I didn't realize that door behind the archivist would lead us here. This place seems ancient. Where does this all lead and what is that thing with the glowing eyes?! Oh, crap..."
   },
   "Key": "ABC0997D47B576471AA9B0A6C37059BC"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Where are we supposed to go now? It looks like there are multiple collapsed tunnels heading off all over the place. Glad I brought my pick for all these rocks."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Where are we supposed to go now? It looks like there are multiple collapsed tunnels heading off all over the place. Glad I brought my pick for all these rocks."
   },
   "Key": "FFDB1B5C49D1C241BCFC02B0EF9E9EE2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "I have uncovered the origination of the grey ones arsenal through my travels to and from the Isle of Siptah. I thought their weaponry could only be found on the Isle, but research shows there was a group of them here in the exiled lands long ago. The old documents I uncovered point to the caverns and catacombs below this town as where they originated from, and I think there may be remnants of the items made by them still hidden somewhere."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "I have uncovered the origination of the grey ones arsenal through my travels to and from the Isle of Siptah. I thought their weaponry could only be found on the Isle, but research shows there was a group of them here in the exiled lands long ago. The old documents I uncovered point to the caverns and catacombs below this town as where they originated from, and I think there may be remnants of the items made by them still hidden somewhere."
   },
   "Key": "44AE3D4E468D88B114D4E88B77463612"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Master Smelter Notes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Master Smelter Notes"
   },
   "Key": "F9A26D4A41A2400F3FB645B2AA7DC94D"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "I’ve been experimenting with this decaying eldarium and scraps those explores brought me. They say they found them off those monsters everyone here talks about lurking in the caverns below. Both are strange materials and easily melt down to eldarium ingot bars, which I haven’t found much use for here. However, by shear mistake, my clumsy apprentice dropped that delivery of argossean dream dust into the demon blood barrel next to the furnace and well, long story short – that barrel got knocked over and some of that concoction mixed with the eldarium bars into the hot furnace while no one was looking, and it converted the ingots into sacred eldarium bars. This is an even stranger metal alloy than the regular eldarium. Once cooled down, it seems to vibrate with some type of harmonic resonance. There is some dark sorcery at work here. I wonder what type of items can be forged with this material."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "I’ve been experimenting with this decaying eldarium and scraps those explores brought me. They say they found them off those monsters everyone here talks about lurking in the caverns below. Both are strange materials and easily melt down to eldarium ingot bars, which I haven’t found much use for here. However, by shear mistake, my clumsy apprentice dropped that delivery of argossean dream dust into the demon blood barrel next to the furnace and well, long story short – that barrel got knocked over and some of that concoction mixed with the eldarium bars into the hot furnace while no one was looking, and it converted the ingots into sacred eldarium bars. This is an even stranger metal alloy than the regular eldarium. Once cooled down, it seems to vibrate with some type of harmonic resonance. There is some dark sorcery at work here. I wonder what type of items can be forged with this material."
   },
   "Key": "E043AC5440AFE56E99DCC1AAFF05AA2F"
  },
