   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Blessed By the Old Serpent"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991102_FourthModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Set's Divine Sedation Arrow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Set's Divine Sedation Arrow"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991103_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An imbued arrow with the unique ability to pacify almost any victim."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An imbued arrow with the unique ability to pacify almost any victim."
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991103_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Although rather unusual in the traditional Set faith, knocking out a victim at distance does have its uses. Especially, when a priest encounters a tough foe."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Although rather unusual in the traditional Set faith, knocking out a victim at distance does have its uses. Especially, when a priest encounters a tough foe."
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991103_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
