  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mace of the Grey Ancients"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Mace of the Grey Ancients"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mace made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mace made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Under the ebon skin long, rounded muscles rippled, and Conan did not doubt that the monster could rend an ordinary man limb from limb. The nails of the fingers provided further weapons, for they were grown like the talons of a wild beast.</> - The Pool of the Black One\n\nThis mace is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.\n\nCapable of shattering bones through armor and crumpling helmets, the mace is a preferred weapon against heavily armored foes, bypassing the protection of their armor through sheer force."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Under the ebon skin long, rounded muscles rippled, and Conan did not doubt that the monster could rend an ordinary man limb from limb. The nails of the fingers provided further weapons, for they were grown like the talons of a wild beast.</> - The Pool of the Black One\n\nThis mace is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.\n\nCapable of shattering bones through armor and crumpling helmets, the mace is a preferred weapon against heavily armored foes, bypassing the protection of their armor through sheer force."
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991107_LongDesc"
  },
