  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Great axe of the Grey Ancients"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Great axe of the Grey Ancients"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A great axe made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A great axe made in imitation of the ancient Grey Ones"
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This greataxe is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.\n\nA weapon that combines the razor edge of the Great Sword with the momentum and weight of the Warhammer, the Great Axe is a vehicle of savagery and slaughter.\n\nThe brutish strength required to swing the weapon with any degree of accuracy means that the weapon is rarely wielded by commoners. More often it is reserved for the ceremonial guards of kings where it is used to convey power and presence."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This greataxe is clearly made by human hands in imitation of the bizarre growths and alien materials that cover the strange beings known as the Grey Ones.\n\nA weapon that combines the razor edge of the Great Sword with the momentum and weight of the Warhammer, the Great Axe is a vehicle of savagery and slaughter.\n\nThe brutish strength required to swing the weapon with any degree of accuracy means that the weapon is rarely wielded by commoners. More often it is reserved for the ceremonial guards of kings where it is used to convey power and presence."
   },
   "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991109_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "High Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
