  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Gauntlets crafted in ancient Aesrian style"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Gauntlets crafted in ancient Aesrian style"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012437_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\"> “By Crom, Niord,” gasped the Cimmerian. ‘Am I alive, or are we all dead and in Valhalla?!”</> - The Frost-Giant’s Daughter By Robert E. Howard. These gauntlets are comprised of both leather and steel plating to provide the wearer with both mobility and protection while at the same time keeping the hands warm."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\"> “By Crom, Niord,” gasped the Cimmerian. ‘Am I alive, or are we all dead and in Valhalla?!”</> - The Frost-Giant’s Daughter By Robert E. Howard. These gauntlets are comprised of both leather and steel plating to provide the wearer with both mobility and protection while at the same time keeping the hands warm."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012437_LongDesc"
