   "Key": "FE0921C34E8EA1146648289D780219D5"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Your direct weapon attacks can trigger Gnawing Hunger, dealing Entropic damage based on the target's remaining health, falling sharply as the target approaches death."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Your direct weapon attacks can trigger Gnawing Hunger, dealing Entropic damage based on the target's remaining health, falling sharply as the target approaches death."
