  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Totem of Jhebbal Sag"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Totem of Jhebbal Sag"
   },
   "Key": "2FD017A34E5BD8EF6FDFE784ED3B390E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Obtain religious equipment"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Obtain religious equipment"
   },
   "Key": "D5756D1D48FEA4F0B3F1599DCCCA9205"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Items with special effects are marked with a small 'EoT' logo in their icon's corner. These items can empower your combat with special magical effects.\r\n\r\nCraft a religious EoT item at an altar or loot one from a dead priest."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Items with special effects are marked with a small 'EoT' logo in their icon's corner. These items can empower your combat with special magical effects.\r\n\r\nCraft a religious EoT item at an altar or loot one from a dead priest."
   },
   "Key": "3C3CCA9F47436651CDEF11A94B8B047E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Gain a religious boon"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Gain a religious boon"
   },
   "Key": "CE20D5884872F7E1D77D969BA291A6D2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Equip a religious weapon or wear at least three pieces from the same religious armor set to gain a special bonus power in combat.\r\n\r\nThe specifics for each bonus can be read in each item's long description (the \"More Info\" button)."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Equip a religious weapon or wear at least three pieces from the same religious armor set to gain a special bonus power in combat.\r\n\r\nThe specifics for each bonus can be read in each item's long description (the \"More Info\" button)."
   },
   "Key": "D214AFC04AE1D7F1A323F496EC8A755F"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Use your new power in battle"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Use your new power in battle"
   },
   "Key": "C28304774FB85BB8695451B7D088B1B2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Trigger a religious weapon effect or armor set bonus in combat. Most of them can be activated by melee or ranged attacks, see the long description of your item for details.\r\n\r\nThese special combat bonuses typically deal one of the five new magic damage types. Mouse over the new icons on your character sheet for more information."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Trigger a religious weapon effect or armor set bonus in combat. Most of them can be activated by melee or ranged attacks, see the long description of your item for details.\r\n\r\nThese special combat bonuses typically deal one of the five new magic damage types. Mouse over the new icons on your character sheet for more information."
   },
   "Key": "A8066DD342C85FA1AA0EBA8C88E4E706"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill a priest to draw the attention of their god, summoning several waves of increasingly difficult religious zealots. Defeat them all for a reward.\r\n\r\nAs you level up you'll unlocked more powerful tiers of Invocations, providing greater challenges and rewarding greater loot.\r\n\r\nEven low-tier Invocations are a substantial challenge early in the game and you don't have to defeat this one to progress the journey."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill a priest to draw the attention of their god, summoning several waves of increasingly difficult religious zealots. Defeat them all for a reward.\r\n\r\nAs you level up you'll unlocked more powerful tiers of Invocations, providing greater challenges and rewarding greater loot.\r\n\r\nEven low-tier Invocations are a substantial challenge early in the game and you don't have to defeat this one to progress the journey."
   },
   "Key": "86C525F8DF157E71B4840F94DF157E71"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Obtain an Orb of Desecration. These profane throwing orbs let you force an invocation at certain religious sites when you are ready."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Obtain an Orb of Desecration. These profane throwing orbs let you force an invocation at certain religious sites when you are ready."
   },
   "Key": "E62471A847DF3F4024DD5BB3C11FE111"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Invocations &\r\nDesecration"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Invocations &\r\nDesecration"
   },
   "Key": "7A8780573E8E120C3D76B0FC3E8E120C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Armaments\r\nof Faith"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Armaments\r\nof Faith"
   },
   "Key": "9E5461624281A02844C76D9E12E8F1DE"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The gods confer powerful boons to those who would champion their cause. Learn how religious equipment can augment your strength in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The gods confer powerful boons to those who would champion their cause. Learn how religious equipment can augment your strength in battle."
   },
   "Key": "B46288B9431627195BC42191B69D73DD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mitraen Tunic"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Mitraen Tunic"
   },
   "Key": "82EB60D246C93B8438238BA49E92C3CD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A simple tunic worn by Mitraen devotees."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A simple tunic worn by Mitraen devotees."
   },
   "Key": "DDE715DA495BFD38BF2BEABFFA7DB10D"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>The servants of Mitra sought no crown of iron and no mask of terror, but walked beneath plain cloth with clear eyes and steady hearts. In the dust of exile, even humility could become a kind of armor.</>\r\n\r\nThis tunic is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Mitra.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Martyr's Radiance: While wearing a Mitraen armor set, your attacks have a very high chance to apply Radiant Burn, dealing 18 Radiant damage over 6 seconds and healing you for the damage dealt each time it ticks. Radiant Burn stacks up to 4 times.</>\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>The servants of Mitra sought no crown of iron and no mask of terror, but walked beneath plain cloth with clear eyes and steady hearts. In the dust of exile, even humility could become a kind of armor.</>\r\n\r\nThis tunic is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Mitra.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Martyr's Radiance: While wearing a Mitraen armor set, your attacks have a very high chance to apply Radiant Burn, dealing 18 Radiant damage over 6 seconds and healing you for the damage dealt each time it ticks. Radiant Burn stacks up to 4 times.</>\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>"
   },
   "Key": "6ADE22AE4F9EDD82748EF6B7DC8B905A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mitraen Gambeson"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Mitraen Gambeson"
   },
   "Key": "33B6CF7F4E15281CEA96A8809E4E0D88"
  },
