  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Headband of Zath"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Headband of Zath"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52645_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A headband worn by dancers of Zath"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A headband worn by dancers of Zath"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52645_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>In Yezud, purity wore beads, silk, and a patient smile. The dancers turned before the black spider's idol while priests whispered of the cleansing to come, when holy venom would find every hidden fault in the flesh of the world.</>\n\nThis headband is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Zath.\n\n<LoreItalics>Zath's Enumeration: Your attacks often inflict Rubric Venom, dealing 16 Entropic damage over 34 seconds, stacking up to 49 times. Upon reaching a stack that is a multiple of 7, a Rubric Mark is placed on the target, stacking up to 10 times. Ally attacks consume 1 Rubric Mark to deal 30 Radiant damage to the target and heal that ally for 60 health over 4 seconds. Upon reaching 49 stacks, the Venom ends and 10 Rubric Marks are placed on the target.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Entropic magic damage sometimes amplifies all physical damage taken by the target for a short while.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>In Yezud, purity wore beads, silk, and a patient smile. The dancers turned before the black spider's idol while priests whispered of the cleansing to come, when holy venom would find every hidden fault in the flesh of the world.</>\n\nThis headband is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Zath.\n\n<LoreItalics>Zath's Enumeration: Your attacks often inflict Rubric Venom, dealing 16 Entropic damage over 34 seconds, stacking up to 49 times. Upon reaching a stack that is a multiple of 7, a Rubric Mark is placed on the target, stacking up to 10 times. Ally attacks consume 1 Rubric Mark to deal 30 Radiant damage to the target and heal that ally for 60 health over 4 seconds. Upon reaching 49 stacks, the Venom ends and 10 Rubric Marks are placed on the target.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Entropic magic damage sometimes amplifies all physical damage taken by the target for a short while.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Radiant magic damage sometimes marks the target, causing them to take additional flat True damage when hit for a short while.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52645_LongDesc"
  },
