  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Saggite Kinship"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Saggite Kinship"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210107_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Pulverizer of the First Pack"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Pulverizer of the First Pack"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210108_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A skull hammer carried by hunters of the First Pack."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A skull hammer carried by hunters of the First Pack."
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210108_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>In the oldest dark, men and beasts answered the same call. Jhebbal Sag was lord of that first kinship, and these weapons were made for those who still hear his command beneath the noise of human words.</>\n\nThis warhammer is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.\n\n<LoreItalics>Saggite Kinship: Your attacks can grant any active beast follower Pack Fury for 30 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. While your beast follower has Pack Fury, its attacks often deal 1 Primal earth damage per stack. Any active beast follower's attacks can grant you Pack Fury for 30 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. Each stack grants you 1% Strength weapon damage and 1% Agility weapon damage.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>In the oldest dark, men and beasts answered the same call. Jhebbal Sag was lord of that first kinship, and these weapons were made for those who still hear his command beneath the noise of human words.</>\n\nThis warhammer is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Jhebbal Sag.\n\n<LoreItalics>Saggite Kinship: Your attacks can grant any active beast follower Pack Fury for 30 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. While your beast follower has Pack Fury, its attacks often deal 1 Primal earth damage per stack. Any active beast follower's attacks can grant you Pack Fury for 30 seconds, stacking up to 20 times. Each stack grants you 1% Strength weapon damage and 1% Agility weapon damage.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210108_LongDesc"
  },
