   "Translation": {
    "Text": "+300 armor"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210128_FourthModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stalwart Infusion"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Stalwart Infusion"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A frigid bottle of pure will to live"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A frigid bottle of pure will to live"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Few know true hardiness in adversity like Ymir's faithful do. No matter how harsh the blizzard, how tall the mountain, how bitter the chill, they find a way. So will you.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to cripple and causes you to rapidly heal when below 30% maximum health for 1 min. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Few know true hardiness in adversity like Ymir's faithful do. No matter how harsh the blizzard, how tall the mountain, how bitter the chill, they find a way. So will you.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to cripple and causes you to rapidly heal when below 30% maximum health for 1 min. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hallowed"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Hallowed"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cripple Immunity"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cripple Immunity"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Heals When Low"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Heals When Low"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210129_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rubric Infusion"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Rubric Infusion"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bottle with perfectly ground facets filled with an odorless poison"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bottle with perfectly ground facets filled with an odorless poison"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The venom is deadly, yes. But it is so much more than that if only one studies it correctly. There is symmetry in its agony. Patterns in the suffering. Divine cleansing in its infliction.\n\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this causes your attacks to apply Rubric Venom to the target for 48 seconds. Rubric Venom lasts 16 seconds, deals Entropic damage, stacks up to 24 times, and cannot be cleansed. Whenever the stacks reach a multiple of 8 (8, 16, 24) a burst of Radiant damage is dealt to all nearby enemies, increasing each time. When Rubric Venom reaches 24 stacks it ends. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The venom is deadly, yes. But it is so much more than that if only one studies it correctly. There is symmetry in its agony. Patterns in the suffering. Divine cleansing in its infliction.\n\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this causes your attacks to apply Rubric Venom to the target for 48 seconds. Rubric Venom lasts 16 seconds, deals Entropic damage, stacks up to 24 times, and cannot be cleansed. Whenever the stacks reach a multiple of 8 (8, 16, 24) a burst of Radiant damage is dealt to all nearby enemies, increasing each time. When Rubric Venom reaches 24 stacks it ends. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hallowed"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Hallowed"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Poison Attacks"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Poison Attacks"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210130_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fury Infusion"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Fury Infusion"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A pungent flask blessed by Jhebbal Sag"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A pungent flask blessed by Jhebbal Sag"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Drink deeply and remember your true nature, human. Remember what you were meant to be. Shed your meekness and hunt.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to stagger and grants you 500 armor for 40 seconds. Every 8 seconds your next attack is empowered with 30% bonus armor penetration and deals bonus Primal earth damage. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Drink deeply and remember your true nature, human. Remember what you were meant to be. Shed your meekness and hunt.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this makes you immune to stagger and grants you 500 armor for 40 seconds. Every 8 seconds your next attack is empowered with 30% bonus armor penetration and deals bonus Primal earth damage. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210131_LongDesc"
  },
