  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Webweaver Arrow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Webweaver Arrow"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Arrows wrapped with blessed spider silk"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Arrows wrapped with blessed spider silk"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "These arrows are wrapped with threads drawn from sacred offerings, primed to cling and coil where they strike. Where the arrow lands, silk spreads across stone and wood alike, turning bare walls into the spider’s highway.\n\n\n<LoreItalics>Webweaving: Your shots create a sticky spider web where they land, increasing climbing speed for any player who climbs on them. Lasts 60 seconds.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "These arrows are wrapped with threads drawn from sacred offerings, primed to cling and coil where they strike. Where the arrow lands, silk spreads across stone and wood alike, turning bare walls into the spider’s highway.\n\n\n<LoreItalics>Webweaving: Your shots create a sticky spider web where they land, increasing climbing speed for any player who climbs on them. Lasts 60 seconds.</>"
   },
   "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210132_LongDesc"
  },
  {
