  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The practice of inscribing sigils into weapons has been invented countless times by countless cultures. The exact symbols used vary across the world but their power is indisputable.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>This weapon modification isn't itself a source of anything; instead it reduces the cooldowns of other effects from weapons, armor sets, or sorcery.</>"
   },
