  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ice Shard Arrow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ice Shard Arrow"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Merge_53658_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Arrows of sacred ice carrying Ymir's killing cold"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Arrows of sacred ice carrying Ymir's killing cold"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Merge_53658_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Better if steel and bowstring prevail without further aid from the arts, for the constant use of mighty spells sometimes sets forces in motion that might rock the universe.</> - The Hour of the Dragon\n\nThese arrows are hewn from ice blessed in Ymir's name, carrying the killing cold of the north wherever they strike.\n\n<LoreItalics>Ice Shard: Shots with these arrows deal Primal water damage instead of physical damage.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Primal magic damage sometimes puts a stacking damage-over-time debuff on your target that deals more Primal damage and can stack from its own damage. Each of the four elements stacks separately.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Better if steel and bowstring prevail without further aid from the arts, for the constant use of mighty spells sometimes sets forces in motion that might rock the universe.</> - The Hour of the Dragon\n\nThese arrows are hewn from ice blessed in Ymir's name, carrying the killing cold of the north wherever they strike.\n\n<LoreItalics>Ice Shard: Shots with these arrows deal Primal water damage instead of physical damage.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Primal magic damage sometimes puts a stacking damage-over-time debuff on your target that deals more Primal damage and can stack from its own damage. Each of the four elements stacks separately.</>"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Merge_53658_LongDesc"
  },
