    "Text": "A fragment of something larger"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210136_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This small chunk of rock bears a mark across one face, as if it's been broken off from something larger and more elaborate. Holding it gives you a sense that unseen truths await discovery.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Shards of Notion are fragments of divine insight gathered through acts of faith. Religious teachers may be interested in these fragments.</>"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This small chunk of rock bears a mark across one face, as if it's been broken off from something larger and more elaborate. Holding it gives you a sense that unseen truths await discovery.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Shards of Notion are fragments of divine insight gathered through acts of faith. Religious teachers may be interested in these fragments.</>"
   },
