   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Ymir asked for no whispered prayers. His altar was the battlefield, his hymn the axe on shield, his blessing the white breath of warriors who would not fall softly. Those who pleased him gave their warmth to the snow and kept only iron, thunder, and resolve.</>\n\nThese leggings are part of a heavy armor set worn by the faithful of Ymir.\n\n<LoreItalics>Ymir's Resolve: When you take damage, you can gain Resolve, healing 60 health over 8 seconds and causing your next attack to apply Rime. Rime deals 120 Primal cold damage over 16 seconds and cripples the target for that time. If you are crippled, you also become immune to cripple and knockback for 6 seconds.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Primal magic damage sometimes puts a stacking damage-over-time debuff on your target that deals more Primal damage and can stack from its own damage. Each of the four elements stacks separately.</>"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210202_LongDesc"
  },
