    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Derketo's softer rites ended at the altar's edge. Beyond silk, perfume, and whispered vows waited the instruments of her harsher devotion: blades for opening desire, hooks for teaching obedience, and killing strokes delivered with a lover's patience.</>\n\nThis goad is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Derketo.\n\n<LoreItalics>Ecstatic Duet: Your attacks apply Temptation for 8 seconds, stacking up to 12 times. Temptation deals 2 Astral damage per stack each second. If any of your active followers are humans of the opposite sex, their attacks consume up to 4 Temptation stacks to deal 5 Astral damage per stack, heal for double that amount, and grant you Indulgence for 8 seconds. Your attacks consume Indulgence to deal 20 bonus Astral damage and restore 40 stamina. Becoming exhausted consumes Indulgence.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Astral magic damage sometimes causes a delayed explosion, damaging enemies in an area and granting you an absorb shield based on damage done.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210247_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Reforged Derketan Heartstring"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Reforged Derketan Heartstring"
   },
   "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210248_Name"
  },
