  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "If enabled, the marker will be saved in your game installation folder and will be shown for characters you have on other servers too. \nIf disabled, it gets saved on your character in the game database."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "If enabled, the marker will be saved in your game installation folder and will be shown for characters you have on other servers too. \nIf disabled, it gets saved on your character in the game database."
