  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom does not listen"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom does not listen"
   },
   "Key": "1D51F7A84CCE0281A736BD8BB7E9FD8D"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom turns and shrugs with genuine indifference, things are as they should be"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom turns and shrugs with genuine indifference, things are as they should be"
   },
   "Key": "646064F641D8DA146689148492A12748"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom sighs...then shrugs and leaves"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom sighs...then shrugs and leaves"
   },
   "Key": "83B778304E498D864B8D3D8BB880E039"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom shakes his shaggy head in disappointment"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom shakes his shaggy head in disappointment"
   },
   "Key": "B3B407C64624AA40B7C3CB9904AEBAFD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom turns and raises his furry eyebrow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom turns and raises his furry eyebrow"
   },
   "Key": "A92C32D847DA614B690C61A43783751E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crom gives a grunt of approval"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Crom gives a grunt of approval"
   },
   "Key": "FA709BE64C1E4E47C3CC7ABC3B55A184"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grey One Mask"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Grey One Mask"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51420_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mask made to imitate the Grey One"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mask made to imitate the Grey One"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51420_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One\n\nIt is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.\n\nThis mask is a gruesome attempt to mimic the face coverings worn by the Grey Ones. It is not as fear inducing as the presence of the creatures themselves, but it captures the eerie diabolism of their features."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Conan mentally termed the creatures black men, for lack of a better term; instinctively he knew that these tall ebony beings were not men, as he understood the term..</> - Pool of the Black One\n\nIt is not known whence came the tall, alien beings known as the Grey Ones. Standing taller than any human, their diabolism is matched only by their raw strength. The inhabitats of the Isle of Siptah know well enough to maintain their distance from these strange beings - those careless enough to be caught simply vanish forever.\n\nThis mask is a gruesome attempt to mimic the face coverings worn by the Grey Ones. It is not as fear inducing as the presence of the creatures themselves, but it captures the eerie diabolism of their features."
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51420_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Light Armor"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Light Armor"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51420_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Medium Cap"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Medium Cap"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_52011_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A riveted leather cap with a facemask"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A riveted leather cap with a facemask"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_52011_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This leather helmet includes large cheek  and neck protectors and a facemask for filtering the sand and dust from the air.\nOffering significantly more protection than light armor, this medium armor incorporates many elements - metal rivets, articulated leather, and fur-trimmed cloth to balance protection and agility. This middle of the road approach brings compromises of its own because this armor is neither as strong as heavy armor, nor as flexible as light armor.\nThis riveted armor bears no cultural markings or identifiers of any type."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This leather helmet includes large cheek  and neck protectors and a facemask for filtering the sand and dust from the air.\nOffering significantly more protection than light armor, this medium armor incorporates many elements - metal rivets, articulated leather, and fur-trimmed cloth to balance protection and agility. This middle of the road approach brings compromises of its own because this armor is neither as strong as heavy armor, nor as flexible as light armor.\nThis riveted armor bears no cultural markings or identifiers of any type."
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_52011_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Medium Armor"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Medium Armor"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_52011_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Medium Cap"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Medium Cap"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_91005_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A riveted leather cap with a facemask"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A riveted leather cap with a facemask"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_91005_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This leather helmet includes large cheek  and neck protectors and a facemask for filtering the sand and dust from the air.\nOffering significantly more protection than light armor, this medium armor incorporates many elements - metal rivets, articulated leather, and fur-trimmed cloth to balance protection and agility. This middle of the road approach brings compromises of its own because this armor is neither as strong as heavy armor, nor as flexible as light armor.\nThis riveted armor bears no cultural markings or identifiers of any type."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This leather helmet includes large cheek  and neck protectors and a facemask for filtering the sand and dust from the air.\nOffering significantly more protection than light armor, this medium armor incorporates many elements - metal rivets, articulated leather, and fur-trimmed cloth to balance protection and agility. This middle of the road approach brings compromises of its own because this armor is neither as strong as heavy armor, nor as flexible as light armor.\nThis riveted armor bears no cultural markings or identifiers of any type."
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_91005_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
