  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Voidforged Dragon Helmet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Voidforged Dragon Helmet"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51378_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A helmet taken from the Voidforge"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A helmet taken from the Voidforge"
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51378_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Inside the Tower of Siptah, on the first floor of the tower, is a place known as the Voidforge. Relics appear here, their origins drawn from across the cosmos. Where the veil between worlds is thinnest, these items are hammered into existence by the Voidforge. Sometimes something simple, sometimes something exotic. The Voidforge does not care for craftsmanship or flair - the rules that govern what appears within are unfathomable."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Inside the Tower of Siptah, on the first floor of the tower, is a place known as the Voidforge. Relics appear here, their origins drawn from across the cosmos. Where the veil between worlds is thinnest, these items are hammered into existence by the Voidforge. Sometimes something simple, sometimes something exotic. The Voidforge does not care for craftsmanship or flair - the rules that govern what appears within are unfathomable."
   },
   "Key": "LFS_ItemTable_51378_LongDesc"
  },
