  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sets the kind of arrow displayed while building\r\n\r\nDefault: LBPR Arrow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sets the kind of arrow displayed while building\r\n\r\nDefault: LBPR Arrow"
   },
   "Key": "C84EEB1145976FCDB1AFC4BB3025F907"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sets a keybind at the player's choosing that will display information of the object (health, stability, clan ownership, etc). Same information as a repair hammer. \r\n\r\nDefault: \"I\" key"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sets a keybind at the player's choosing that will display information of the object (health, stability, clan ownership, etc). Same information as a repair hammer. \r\n\r\nDefault: \"I\" key"
   },
   "Key": "6AD91EE54B4EBC824C1A5EAE13C939D8"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will enable or disable the \"ghost\" brush seen when building. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will enable or disable the \"ghost\" brush seen when building. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "4FDB07B246B144D5DD2381AB59C6EC12"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Turning this on allows individual players to set a keybind to display building info (same information as the Repair Hammer).\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Turning this on allows individual players to set a keybind to display building info (same information as the Repair Hammer).\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "626B2C0E4E5E27764F101C896915E980"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows extra degrees of rotation for buildings based upon the chosen setting. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows extra degrees of rotation for buildings based upon the chosen setting. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "20AC2125439CADB5E4B1A1BBA36BDB82"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Disables several anti-exploit (for PVP) checks for Fence Foundations.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Disables several anti-exploit (for PVP) checks for Fence Foundations.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "939492324EC29AD8DC8ED588B9E10D01"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting is intended for players who wish to make certain dungeons their home and still want to be able to climb. \r\n\r\nNote: The setting must be enabled while nobody is in the targeted area for it to properly work. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting is intended for players who wish to make certain dungeons their home and still want to be able to climb. \r\n\r\nNote: The setting must be enabled while nobody is in the targeted area for it to properly work. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "F4AF0628469DA9EB3A22489131CD2569"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Disables ALL checks for building overlaps. \r\n\r\nNote: This does not prevent upgrading/sidegrading. It also does not disable the anti-exploit measures when stacking multiple buildings of the same type on top of each other (such as the same foundation). That setting is found in C++ and cannot be disabled by mod creators. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Disables ALL checks for building overlaps. \r\n\r\nNote: This does not prevent upgrading/sidegrading. It also does not disable the anti-exploit measures when stacking multiple buildings of the same type on top of each other (such as the same foundation). That setting is found in C++ and cannot be disabled by mod creators. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "4C339728418249A61039228D3CAC6045"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Disables ALL checks for building overlaps. \r\n\r\nNote: This does not prevent upgrading/sidegrading. It also does not disable the anti-exploit measures when stacking multiple buildings of the same type on top of each other (such as the same foundation). That setting is found in C++ and cannot be disabled by mod creators. \r\n\r\nNote2: The \"everyone\" toggle must be disabled for this setting to work properly. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Disables ALL checks for building overlaps. \r\n\r\nNote: This does not prevent upgrading/sidegrading. It also does not disable the anti-exploit measures when stacking multiple buildings of the same type on top of each other (such as the same foundation). That setting is found in C++ and cannot be disabled by mod creators. \r\n\r\nNote2: The \"everyone\" toggle must be disabled for this setting to work properly. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "B7CA99C04D1FA32FA1BB53AEAA0034C5"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting disables all custom LBPR overlaps found in the mod. There are many carefuly crafted custom overlaps that have been added, and this setting will disable them all. \r\n\r\nExamples of this are things like:\r\n\r\n* Walls overlapping Foundations\r\n* Fences overlapping Doorways \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting disables all custom LBPR overlaps found in the mod. There are many carefuly crafted custom overlaps that have been added, and this setting will disable them all. \r\n\r\nExamples of this are things like:\r\n\r\n* Walls overlapping Foundations\r\n* Fences overlapping Doorways \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "D253816245C19218AF900B8CC873F15F"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting disables ALL instances of upgrading buildings and sidegrading (replacing one wall with another wall as an example). Best used when Full Building Overlaps is also turned on. Finally, this setting turns on the feature for everyone on the server. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting disables ALL instances of upgrading buildings and sidegrading (replacing one wall with another wall as an example). Best used when Full Building Overlaps is also turned on. Finally, this setting turns on the feature for everyone on the server. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "82367D904BE210C17DF0189C1EF75EF7"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows building in restricted zones for everybody\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows building in restricted zones for everybody\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "F721D1E34D5B3959FF2C0E9DD3320D68"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows building in restricted zones for admins only.\r\n\r\nNote: Everyone toggle must be disabled\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows building in restricted zones for admins only.\r\n\r\nNote: Everyone toggle must be disabled\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "FFF86A674072685BC1FEE0A85C1C30B7"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This allows building underground when enabled. This setting is required for building in various caves and dungeons\r\n\r\nNote: Must also enable \"Everyone\" or \"Only Admins Allowed to Build Anywhere\" to have desired effect\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This allows building underground when enabled. This setting is required for building in various caves and dungeons\r\n\r\nNote: Must also enable \"Everyone\" or \"Only Admins Allowed to Build Anywhere\" to have desired effect\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "BCA854F7427238B6C143F4814947A9FD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sets the placeable directional arrow to always show, use vanilla settings, or always off\r\n\r\nDefault: Placeable Arrow Always On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sets the placeable directional arrow to always show, use vanilla settings, or always off\r\n\r\nDefault: Placeable Arrow Always On"
   },
   "Key": "E72A928849F9848CD0FCD0B11CBB3BB1"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will enable or disable the \"ghost\" brush seen when placing placeables. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will enable or disable the \"ghost\" brush seen when placing placeables. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "CAD504CC409E0C09CF5168B84AB2956E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will bypass the vanilla restrictions on tilt and pitch, and go up to desired amount. In vanilla, the maximum amount is 30 degress.\r\n\r\nTip: If Pitch/Tilt isn't working right. Try swapping this toggle from off to on (or vice versa). \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will bypass the vanilla restrictions on tilt and pitch, and go up to desired amount. In vanilla, the maximum amount is 30 degress.\r\n\r\nTip: If Pitch/Tilt isn't working right. Try swapping this toggle from off to on (or vice versa). \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "B273C7414AEAFB4CCAA135BCD9C9C90E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Server Max Value: Displays the maximum value you (the player) can set the placeable rotation to. The is maximum value is set by server admins. \r\n\r\nDefault: 180"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Server Max Value: Displays the maximum value you (the player) can set the placeable rotation to. The is maximum value is set by server admins. \r\n\r\nDefault: 180"
   },
   "Key": "AC29B7D24F700CF0FF0964A505DF83E5"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will enable pitch and tilt settings for players (client specific). The setting is invisible to players until this toggle is turned on. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will enable pitch and tilt settings for players (client specific). The setting is invisible to players until this toggle is turned on. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "8A3EB9EC47761D9985C61F84E35F9504"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows admins to prevent clients from being able to go past a certain value on the Pitch and Client setting as desired. The maximum amount in vanilla is 30 degrees. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows admins to prevent clients from being able to go past a certain value on the Pitch and Client setting as desired. The maximum amount in vanilla is 30 degrees. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "B930E344FC204AC6AC799F53FC204AC6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allow all placeables to be able to be placed underwater. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allow all placeables to be able to be placed underwater. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "D0A4AB414939C447A0F9C7BE55C75E24"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This disables the \"Not Aligned With the Ground\" blockers. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This disables the \"Not Aligned With the Ground\" blockers. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "5CB314A4473C9409A9CFA3957CA8E2D1"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will disable some, but not all, checks for floor contact when placing items. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will disable some, but not all, checks for floor contact when placing items. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "A03518FF47919127326A5FA6C8AE25BE"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Placeables placed on the ground will ignore overlapping checks. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Placeables placed on the ground will ignore overlapping checks. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "77D233DA4116D5364CCEB181C4D64F93"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will always set the allow placeable stacking to true on every placeable. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will always set the allow placeable stacking to true on every placeable. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "5C8D89D54FBBED5375F060A5591EF0D3"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting makes it so Doors/Gates will stack on top of each other. Gates will be able to be placed in a Gateframe no matter how buried the Gateframe is. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting makes it so Doors/Gates will stack on top of each other. Gates will be able to be placed in a Gateframe no matter how buried the Gateframe is. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "1101BE2A481690DD8BD3F69BE464DBAA"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting allows Altars to be placed near each other without restriction.\r\n\r\nNote: Must have \"Allow All \"Exclusives\" to be Placed Near Each Other\" toggle off for this to work. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting allows Altars to be placed near each other without restriction.\r\n\r\nNote: Must have \"Allow All \"Exclusives\" to be Placed Near Each Other\" toggle off for this to work. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "C09D0BBB4BF4086869E489A0F03968BC"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This allows Altars to bypass checks for alignment, stacking, and overlapping. Turning this on can cause Altars to blow up during the upgrade process if an overlap is detected or other vanilla blockers have been bypassed that Altar upgrading relies on.  \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This allows Altars to bypass checks for alignment, stacking, and overlapping. Turning this on can cause Altars to blow up during the upgrade process if an overlap is detected or other vanilla blockers have been bypassed that Altar upgrading relies on.  \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "0A60BBDF4FCFFDF047963598DB1117AE"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting will allow placeables to ignore spawnpoint overlapping. \r\n\r\nNote: Players can absolutely block their own spawn points by placing too many decorations around their beds. Make sure to keep the desired spawnpoint clear of objects. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting will allow placeables to ignore spawnpoint overlapping. \r\n\r\nNote: Players can absolutely block their own spawn points by placing too many decorations around their beds. Make sure to keep the desired spawnpoint clear of objects. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "35AB3E494B0828C12E78C8B59F503424"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Will bypass the vanilla restrictions on tilt and pitch for wall placeables. It will than tilt/pitch to desired amount set by the 'Pitch and Tilt Maximum Value' client setting. \r\n\r\nTip: If Pitch/Tilt isn't working right. Try swapping this toggle from off to on (or vice versa). \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Will bypass the vanilla restrictions on tilt and pitch for wall placeables. It will than tilt/pitch to desired amount set by the 'Pitch and Tilt Maximum Value' client setting. \r\n\r\nTip: If Pitch/Tilt isn't working right. Try swapping this toggle from off to on (or vice versa). \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "391DA94B46B0B183B7AD8B9EDDFB1124"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Placeables placed on walls will ignore overlapping checks. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Placeables placed on walls will ignore overlapping checks. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "14B1A0F040B15970DBC0828DF224BCED"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting specifically bypasses checks for surfaces that are considered not \"vertical\" enough. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting specifically bypasses checks for surfaces that are considered not \"vertical\" enough. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "7B0C397744E855D2E3C3028DFA2519CB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting disables checks for not enough contact on wall. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting disables checks for not enough contact on wall. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "1ABBDC3E4DD1ADE3966E83AB5763512B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Many world objects (NPC villages, ETC) prevent placing wall decorations on them. This setting bypasses those checks for such things.  \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Many world objects (NPC villages, ETC) prevent placing wall decorations on them. This setting bypasses those checks for such things.  \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "F70EE31F42AAC06AA2A1B098B62AD320"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The setting allows notes, bedrolls, and signs to be placed on Player Land Claim. Placeables can be destroyed by admins using the Construction Hammer. Great for RP Servers. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The setting allows notes, bedrolls, and signs to be placed on Player Land Claim. Placeables can be destroyed by admins using the Construction Hammer. Great for RP Servers. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "8060F031448D4EDA7C3E63B39DE8C1FB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allow Followers to Overlap just about everything.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allow Followers to Overlap just about everything.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "E37B2D7F42D9ACDE1CA786A4878B86A9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of Followers near other Followers without restriction.\r\n\r\nNote: This setting can also be disabled via the ServerSettings.ini file. Having it in LBPR just gives admins an easier way to disable this check. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of Followers near other Followers without restriction.\r\n\r\nNote: This setting can also be disabled via the ServerSettings.ini file. Having it in LBPR just gives admins an easier way to disable this check. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "A96E4AFA4104D7D4FC059E8249034E45"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Followers that are set to Large Heights often are blocked from placing. This setting fixes that. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Followers that are set to Large Heights often are blocked from placing. This setting fixes that. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "8AD997EC4DE0B058FEBB67979583F0C6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of followers in vanilla restricted zones for everybody\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of followers in vanilla restricted zones for everybody\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "757C7C18430BE008300DA7B3FD4857C2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of followers in vanilla restricted zones for admins only.\r\n\r\nNote: Everyone toggle must be disabled\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows placement of followers in vanilla restricted zones for admins only.\r\n\r\nNote: Everyone toggle must be disabled\r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "68657A154FB4DC34637B4F85B4D4C16C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This allows placing followers underground when enabled. This setting is required for placing Followers in various caves and dungeons. \r\n\r\nNote: Must also enable 'Allowed to Place Followers Anywhere' for Everyone/Admin to have desired effect\r\n\r\nNote2: May not do anything anymore and is more of a Legacy setting at this point. If you see this note and have some observations to share about this setting, please do so on the BBB discord. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This allows placing followers underground when enabled. This setting is required for placing Followers in various caves and dungeons. \r\n\r\nNote: Must also enable 'Allowed to Place Followers Anywhere' for Everyone/Admin to have desired effect\r\n\r\nNote2: May not do anything anymore and is more of a Legacy setting at this point. If you see this note and have some observations to share about this setting, please do so on the BBB discord. \r\n\r\nDefault: Off"
   },
   "Key": "B41B639F4C7F73AD1E44DE9F49B4A809"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting keeps the game from checking for instances where \"View Obstructed\" would come up. These are things like when trying to place a placeable behind a wall, for example. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting keeps the game from checking for instances where \"View Obstructed\" would come up. These are things like when trying to place a placeable behind a wall, for example. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "FB90020A4E0F95C654C1578BEF09060E"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This setting allows wall placeables to be stacked ontop of other placeables.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This setting allows wall placeables to be stacked ontop of other placeables.\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "BFA2EAD9446455F0BF9B80A16ED7B10C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows climbing on drawbridges. This is blocked in vanilla otherwise. \r\n\r\nImportant Note: Be sure to place new drawbridges (if previously placed) when changing this setting!\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows climbing on drawbridges. This is blocked in vanilla otherwise. \r\n\r\nImportant Note: Be sure to place new drawbridges (if previously placed) when changing this setting!\r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "F28F049B4603AEB05DDE2B9271B59950"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Drawbridges will place even if a Gate is already placed and is otherwise easier to place if things are in the way.  \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Drawbridges will place even if a Gate is already placed and is otherwise easier to place if things are in the way.  \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "3FF59D964BBBE73D55AB16BD3C2D1E44"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Allows all placeables to be placed near each other that use \"Exclusive\" spheres. Exclusive spheres prevent placing next to likeminded exclusives without this toggle on. For example, Altar's use exclusive spheres, wells, and etc. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Allows all placeables to be placed near each other that use \"Exclusive\" spheres. Exclusive spheres prevent placing next to likeminded exclusives without this toggle on. For example, Altar's use exclusive spheres, wells, and etc. \r\n\r\nDefault: On"
   },
   "Key": "A40BE3484D1EF96A82B7F1B9B58F9EF0"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Click For Help"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Click For Help"
   },
   "Key": "612C67604DF45DDCE256C5BDFC0AE3EB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Less Building Placement Restrictions - Read Below for Additional Information\r\n\r\nDescriptions of each setting are available. Simply hover your mouse over the setting to gain additional information (right panel).\r\n\r\nFor more information on all the available settings, please visit the available documentation."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Less Building Placement Restrictions - Read Below for Additional Information\r\n\r\nDescriptions of each setting are available. Simply hover your mouse over the setting to gain additional information (right panel).\r\n\r\nFor more information on all the available settings, please visit the available documentation."
   },
   "Key": "788074F84512B46F383E1EAE988F81B5"
