    "Text": "An ancient weapon- wielded in the off-hand"
   },
   "Key": "F6089AAD44E4DD7980CA77BA5707EA73"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Conan stood in the moonlit silence, the dripping sword sagging in his hand, staring down at the remnants of his enemy. The red eyes glared up at him with awful life, then glazed and set - the great hands knotted spasmodically and stiffened. And the oldest race in the world was extinct.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\r\n\r\nThis curved short sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Conan stood in the moonlit silence, the dripping sword sagging in his hand, staring down at the remnants of his enemy. The red eyes glared up at him with awful life, then glazed and set - the great hands knotted spasmodically and stiffened. And the oldest race in the world was extinct.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\r\n\r\nThis curved short sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Key": "075154CE4C172425398B0AA223ED539A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cooling"
   },
   "Translation": {
