   "Key": "BB243E764C41C96BA7170893EFD12D5B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics> In an instant he was the center of a hurricane of stabbing spears and lashing clubs. But he moved in a blinding blur of steel. Spears bent on his armor or swished empty air, and his sword sang its death-song.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\r\n\r\nThis curved short sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the Wakizashi designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics> In an instant he was the center of a hurricane of stabbing spears and lashing clubs. But he moved in a blinding blur of steel. Spears bent on his armor or swished empty air, and his sword sang its death-song.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\r\n\r\nThis curved short sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the Wakizashi designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Key": "F2EDF12C42C57B9FF6A36CBC7F431E71"
  },
