   "Key": "6D36E7EF4641762B8A6707985B1BBEE6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Voidforge Wakizashi"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Voidforge Wakizashi"
   },
   "Key": "BD1F50F14EF02E7DEE93B18A79B7D7F6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced wakizashi marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. Wielded in the off-hand "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced wakizashi marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. Wielded in the off-hand "
   },
   "Key": "69F2244F4071B62191B899B49F0CCE16"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the sword's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \r\n\r\nIn contrast with the typical shortsword, the katana is a curved weapon with a single outward facing blade edge meant for slashing instead of thrusting. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the sword's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \r\n\r\nIn contrast with the typical shortsword, the katana is a curved weapon with a single outward facing blade edge meant for slashing instead of thrusting. "
   },
   "Key": "9D89E150414CEA7D767BDDBB69BCE6CA"
  },
