   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics> They stopped short. Conan faced them, not a naked man roused mazed and unarmed out of deep sleep to be butchered like a sheep, but a barbarian wide-awake and at bay, partly armored, and with his long sword in his hand.</> - The Phoenix on the Sword\n\nThis curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_24217_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Conan stood in the moonlit silence, the dripping sword sagging in his hand, staring down at the remnants of his enemy. The red eyes glared up at him with awful life, then glazed and set - the great hands knotted spasmodically and stiffened. And the oldest race in the world was extinct.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\n\nThis curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Conan stood in the moonlit silence, the dripping sword sagging in his hand, staring down at the remnants of his enemy. The red eyes glared up at him with awful life, then glazed and set - the great hands knotted spasmodically and stiffened. And the oldest race in the world was extinct.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\n\nThis curved sword is ancient in design and may well be the precursor to the designs found in Yamatai."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_24222_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced katana marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced katana marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. "
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50580_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the sword's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \n\nIn contrast with the typical longsword, the katana is a curved weapon with a single outward facing blade edge meant for slashing instead of thrusting. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the sword's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \n\nIn contrast with the typical longsword, the katana is a curved weapon with a single outward facing blade edge meant for slashing instead of thrusting. "
   },
