   "Key": "AEF6366E4657FAD0421F91896810373A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>A long bow and a strong bow, and let the sky grow dark! The cord to the nock, the shaft to the ear, and the king of Koth for a mark!</> - Song of the Bossonian Archers.\r\n\r\nCarved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants.\r\n\r\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\r\n\r\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the wielder."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>A long bow and a strong bow, and let the sky grow dark! The cord to the nock, the shaft to the ear, and the king of Koth for a mark!</> - Song of the Bossonian Archers.\r\n\r\nCarved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants.\r\n\r\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\r\n\r\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the wielder."
   },
   "Key": "AB99A3C54802E5F37D87E88095E38112"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Kerim Shah had unslung the powerful Turanian bow that killed at five hundred paces, and the Irakzai looked to their own lighter and less lethal bows.</> - The People of the Black Circle\r\n\r\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
