  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sturdy Bone Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sturdy Bone Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted of bone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted of bone"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This bow has been crafted from the bones of an unknown beast - the bones are strangely bendable and sturdy despite the apparent age of the bow. Whomever put this bow together prioritized sturdiness over accuracy and damage."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This bow has been crafted from the bones of an unknown beast - the bones are strangely bendable and sturdy despite the apparent age of the bow. Whomever put this bow together prioritized sturdiness over accuracy and damage."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Legendary"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Legendary"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Feroxic Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Feroxic Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted from the chitinous remains of an ancient predator. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted from the chitinous remains of an ancient predator. "
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Shaped from the sturdy but remarkably sinuous spine of the extinct Feroxodon pufferfish, this compact bow generates the same relative arrow velocity as much larger weapons. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Shaped from the sturdy but remarkably sinuous spine of the extinct Feroxodon pufferfish, this compact bow generates the same relative arrow velocity as much larger weapons. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Featherlight Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Featherlight Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow shaped from the hollow, adamantine bones of a winged monstrosity. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow shaped from the hollow, adamantine bones of a winged monstrosity. "
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Featherlight weaponry is highly sought after by those who count stealth as a professional virtue. The nearly weightless material is difficult to craft and even more difficult to wield as it lacks the heft and dimension associated with balanced weaponry. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Featherlight weaponry is highly sought after by those who count stealth as a professional virtue. The nearly weightless material is difficult to craft and even more difficult to wield as it lacks the heft and dimension associated with balanced weaponry. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Harpy's Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Harpy's Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow etched with a mesmerizing swirl pattern of unfathomable depth."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow etched with a mesmerizing swirl pattern of unfathomable depth."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The swirl pattern adorning the bow length is a form of arcane barrier trapping a demon within. While the demon is unable to communicate in any way, it still hungers for killing. To the ignorant archer, the bow seems to seek an enemy's vulnerable spots almost of its own volition. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The swirl pattern adorning the bow length is a form of arcane barrier trapping a demon within. While the demon is unable to communicate in any way, it still hungers for killing. To the ignorant archer, the bow seems to seek an enemy's vulnerable spots almost of its own volition. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Voidforge Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Voidforge Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced bow marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced bow marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. "
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the bow's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the bow's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ripping"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ripping"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Blood-Moon Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Blood-Moon Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin, coated in the caustic gore of the Blood Moon Beast. This overgrown specimen of Moon Beast towers above even the largest of man-sized opponents and can easily swallow one whole. The beast's innards hold a veritable treasure trove of partially digested objects and even a pristine item or two. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin, coated in the caustic gore of the Blood Moon Beast. This overgrown specimen of Moon Beast towers above even the largest of man-sized opponents and can easily swallow one whole. The beast's innards hold a veritable treasure trove of partially digested objects and even a pristine item or two. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_LongDesc"
  },
