    "Text": "Powerful Hunting Bow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Powerful Hunting Bow"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A finely crafted bow for hunting."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A finely crafted bow for hunting."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Carved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants. In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\n\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the archer."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Carved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants. In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\n\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the archer."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_LongDesc"
