   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This bow is made in the Hyrkanian style, using different materials to strengthen different areas of the bow and allowing it to be shorter than a longbow. For Hyrkanians, who spend most of their lives shooting from horseback, this is a necessity.\n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This bow is made in the Hyrkanian style, using different materials to strengthen different areas of the bow and allowing it to be shorter than a longbow. For Hyrkanians, who spend most of their lives shooting from horseback, this is a necessity.\n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Derketo's Voice"
   },
   "Translation": {
