  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A legendary bow that boosts accuracy"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A legendary bow that boosts accuracy"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "When the Lemurians fled their islands, they were captured and enslaved by the mysterious race that lived on the eastern shores of the Thurian continent.\n\nA remnant of a remnant escaped that slavery and crossed the world in search of succor.\n\nThousands of people, weary and terrified, needed to be protected and fed as they crossed hostile kingdoms, ghost-haunted moors and the jungles full of dangerous creatures.\n\nA group of women, known as Dagon's Daughters, volunteered to protect the group. They were experts with the bow, and agile fighters at close range.\n\nThis bow, simply known as The Huntress, once belonged to Dagon's Daughters."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "When the Lemurians fled their islands, they were captured and enslaved by the mysterious race that lived on the eastern shores of the Thurian continent.\n\nA remnant of a remnant escaped that slavery and crossed the world in search of succor.\n\nThousands of people, weary and terrified, needed to be protected and fed as they crossed hostile kingdoms, ghost-haunted moors and the jungles full of dangerous creatures.\n\nA group of women, known as Dagon's Daughters, volunteered to protect the group. They were experts with the bow, and agile fighters at close range.\n\nThis bow, simply known as The Huntress, once belonged to Dagon's Daughters."
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_LongDesc"
