   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_92094_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "It is unknown as to which specific demonic entity is bound to this bow, but whichever it is, it hungers for death. A pity, then, that the entity this demon possessed was merely a goat. Otherwise, this weapon could have been quite formidable."
   },
   "Translation": {
