    "Text": "Bracers of blood-dyed leather"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_6952513_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "It is no secret that Darfari consume the flesh of the dead but the horrible reality of the Exiled Lands has forced them to perform other perverted acts. This includes stripping the skin from their victims to create a soft leather that can be used for crafting armor.\nThese bracers are the color of blood and made of a soft leather wrapped with cloth. A close look reveals human molars dangling from the bindings on the gauntlets.\n\nLight armor provides the most flexibility and range of movement in combat, but at the cost of significant protection in battle."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "It is no secret that Darfari consume the flesh of the dead but the horrible reality of the Exiled Lands has forced them to perform other perverted acts. This includes stripping the skin from their victims to create a soft leather that can be used for crafting armor.\nThese bracers are the color of blood and made of a soft leather wrapped with cloth. A close look reveals human molars dangling from the bindings on the gauntlets.\n\nLight armor provides the most flexibility and range of movement in combat, but at the cost of significant protection in battle."
