   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_6995916_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A simple iron circlet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A simple iron circlet"
   },
   "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_6995916_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Followers of Mitra commit to a life of simplicty and dignity. They prefer knowledge to ritual and the calm of meditation to the storm of battle.This circlet reflects the simple principles of the Mitraen devout."
   },
   "Translation": {
