  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Reach of the Red Mother"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Reach of the Red Mother"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50523_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted of exquisite dragonbone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted of exquisite dragonbone"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50523_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>And their magicians made a terrible magic to guard the city; for by their necromantic arts they re-created the dragons which had once dwelt in this lost land, and whose monstrous bones they found in the forest. Those bones they clothed in flesh and life, and the living beasts walked the earth as they walked it when time was young.</> - Red Nails\n\nThrough the long passage of eons, rumors of dragons have always been passed down from generation to generation, and the legacy of these fearsome creatures grows with each telling."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>And their magicians made a terrible magic to guard the city; for by their necromantic arts they re-created the dragons which had once dwelt in this lost land, and whose monstrous bones they found in the forest. Those bones they clothed in flesh and life, and the living beasts walked the earth as they walked it when time was young.</> - Red Nails\n\nThrough the long passage of eons, rumors of dragons have always been passed down from generation to generation, and the legacy of these fearsome creatures grows with each telling."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50523_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Legendary"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Legendary"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50523_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Boots that crunch like snow with every step"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Boots that crunch like snow with every step"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_52614_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Above him the skies glowed and crackled with strange lights and gleams. The snow shone weirdly, now frosty blue, now icy crimson, now cold silver. Through a shimmering icy realm of enchantment Conan plunged doggedly onward, in a crystalline maze where the only reality was the white body dancing across the glittering snow beyond his reach - ever beyond his reach.</> - The Frost-Giant's Daughter\n\nThese boots of winter weirdness mark one as devout to Ymir, Father of Giants, Lord of Storm and War."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Above him the skies glowed and crackled with strange lights and gleams. The snow shone weirdly, now frosty blue, now icy crimson, now cold silver. Through a shimmering icy realm of enchantment Conan plunged doggedly onward, in a crystalline maze where the only reality was the white body dancing across the glittering snow beyond his reach - ever beyond his reach.</> - The Frost-Giant's Daughter\n\nThese boots of winter weirdness mark one as devout to Ymir, Father of Giants, Lord of Storm and War."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_52614_LongDesc"
  },
