  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dark Crystal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Dark Crystal"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Black transparent, shimmering stone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Black transparent, shimmering stone"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Brittle, impossible to work with conventional tools, crystal is mostly used for focusing light and creating rudimentary lenses.\nThe Black Seers of Mount Yimsha craft great lenses to aid in their astrological divinations. Black sorceries gain potency when the heavens are in certain configurations."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Brittle, impossible to work with conventional tools, crystal is mostly used for focusing light and creating rudimentary lenses.\nThe Black Seers of Mount Yimsha craft great lenses to aid in their astrological divinations. Black sorceries gain potency when the heavens are in certain configurations."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790349_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dark Mortar"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Dark Mortar"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This cold, hard artificial lava is of no further interest, unless heated in an Ancient Furnace"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This cold, hard artificial lava is of no further interest, unless heated in an Ancient Furnace"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.\nHowever, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. \nIchor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.\nHowever, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. \nIchor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790345_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Molten Mortar"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Molten Mortar"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A true artificial lava, this mixture must still be molten to strengthen the Darkstone and obtain the famous Ancient Stone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A true artificial lava, this mixture must still be molten to strengthen the Darkstone and obtain the famous Ancient Stone"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.\nHowever, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. \nIchor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The Exiled Lands stand as a testament to the efficacy of weather at destroying the works of man. When the wind howls across the landscape and the sand scours everything in its path, there are few buildings that survive for very long.\nHowever, the supernaturally large insects of the Exiled Lands have developed a natural secretion that helps to protect them against the environment. \nIchor from these creatures, when soaked into twine and bound to a stone surface, can be placed into a furnace and hardened into bricks that provide excellent protection against the rigors of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790350_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Stone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Stone"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Chunk of dark stone obtained by burning stone using dark powder as fuel"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Chunk of dark stone obtained by burning stone using dark powder as fuel"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.\nEven the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Most humble of materials and most common, stone is the building block of civilization. From the primitive weapons of Picts to the marble sheathed palaces of Aquilonian Kings, stone is the foundation upon which all is predicated.\nEven the elder races, who vanished from the earth without a trace, left behind great ruined cities of brooding stone to mark their passing."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790347_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dark Wood"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Dark Wood"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wood treated with resin"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Wood treated with resin"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wood is an abundant source of fuel and building material.\nReadily available and easily shaped with the right tools, wood is ubiquitous in the weapons and buildings of primitive tribes and mighty nations.\n\nWood allows for the creation of fire and its easy transport.\n\nThis wood has been treated with resin, making it stronger and more weather resistant."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Wood is an abundant source of fuel and building material.\nReadily available and easily shaped with the right tools, wood is ubiquitous in the weapons and buildings of primitive tribes and mighty nations.\n\nWood allows for the creation of fire and its easy transport.\n\nThis wood has been treated with resin, making it stronger and more weather resistant."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790344_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Calcined Iron Bar"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Calcined Iron Bar"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Iron ingot burnt and oxidized by black powder"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Iron ingot burnt and oxidized by black powder"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The ability to work iron is a step along the road from savagery to civilization. The streets of the great cities of the world resound with the ring of hammer on anvil a song to the march of progress.\nIron weapons and armor offer superior protection, but the additional weight means carrying less supplies.\nIron can be treated with Steelfire in a Furnace to produce steel."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The ability to work iron is a step along the road from savagery to civilization. The streets of the great cities of the world resound with the ring of hammer on anvil a song to the march of progress.\nIron weapons and armor offer superior protection, but the additional weight means carrying less supplies.\nIron can be treated with Steelfire in a Furnace to produce steel."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mid Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Mid Grade"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Meltable"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Meltable"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3790342_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Crafting Table"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Crafting Table"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A table with all the tools required for miscellaneous creations"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A table with all the tools required for miscellaneous creations"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780759_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Grinder"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Grinder"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A ancient grinder to craft dark powder"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A ancient grinder to craft dark powder"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Designed to grind crystal, brimstone and coal into a fine black powder with high burning power. This powder is then used as fuel in the ancient furnace to transform stone into Dark Stone and iron bars into Calcined Iron Bar."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Designed to grind crystal, brimstone and coal into a fine black powder with high burning power. This powder is then used as fuel in the ancient furnace to transform stone into Dark Stone and iron bars into Calcined Iron Bar."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Fuel Usage"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Low Fuel Usage"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780845_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Furnace"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Furnace"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A furnace for smelting metals and stone (required dark powder)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A furnace for smelting metals and stone (required dark powder)"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Fuel Usage"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Low Fuel Usage"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780754_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Forge"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Forge"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780751_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A forge with glowing lava"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A forge with glowing lava"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780751_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Stone Cutter"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Stone Cutter"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bench with all the tools required to carve Dark stones"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bench with all the tools required to carve Dark stones"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780837_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Construction Site"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Construction Site"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A building site for crafting construction elements"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A building site for crafting construction elements"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780836_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Crane"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Crane"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A useful crane for building construction elements"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A useful crane for building construction elements"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sometimes a saw and a hammer are simply not enough. This worktable contains a variety of small tools that are uniquely suited to various tasks that involve the creation of dozens of miscellaneous objects."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780799_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Mineshaft"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Mineshaft"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A dark mineshaft"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A dark mineshaft"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mineshaft can be abandoned, unless it can still be used to exploit some valuable resources."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mineshaft can be abandoned, unless it can still be used to exploit some valuable resources."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780842_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Mine Cart"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Mine Cart"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mine cart made of wood and iron"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mine cart made of wood and iron"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Often made of wood and featuring shelves and doors, cupboards are places to stow dishware or even display certain ornaments or property."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Often made of wood and featuring shelves and doors, cupboards are places to stow dishware or even display certain ornaments or property."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780795_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Stool"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Stool"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A carved stone stool"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A carved stone stool"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sometimes after a day of killing and slaying, all an Exile wants to do is sit down and relax.\nStools are often used as makeshift weapons in tavern brawls across Hyboria, usually hurled at an opponent in between curses."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sometimes after a day of killing and slaying, all an Exile wants to do is sit down and relax.\nStools are often used as makeshift weapons in tavern brawls across Hyboria, usually hurled at an opponent in between curses."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780797_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Chair"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Chair"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A carved stone chair"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A carved stone chair"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Commonly found only in the houses of the wealthy or noble, chairs with armrests and backs are considered a mark of refinement."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Commonly found only in the houses of the wealthy or noble, chairs with armrests and backs are considered a mark of refinement."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780838_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bench"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bench"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A carved stone bench"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A carved stone bench"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Benches like this are common in the taverns and alehouses of the world. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Benches like this are common in the taverns and alehouses of the world. "
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780792_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Hanging Shelf"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Hanging Shelf"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A shelf for displaying objects"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A shelf for displaying objects"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This simple shelf can be placed against almost any wall and used to display small objects."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This simple shelf can be placed against almost any wall and used to display small objects."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780791_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Table"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Table"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A rectangular carved stone table"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A rectangular carved stone table"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tables vary in shape and size, materials and decoration based on the culture and craftsmanship of their maker.\nThis one is a wooden rectangle.\nThe artisan was probably hoping to decorate the table with dozens of interesting objects and thereby distract from the lack of imagination in the creation of the table itself."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Tables vary in shape and size, materials and decoration based on the culture and craftsmanship of their maker.\nThis one is a wooden rectangle.\nThe artisan was probably hoping to decorate the table with dozens of interesting objects and thereby distract from the lack of imagination in the creation of the table itself."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780761_LongDesc"
