  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bed"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bed"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780787_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A comfortable dark stone bed"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A comfortable dark stone bed"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780787_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Few of the inhabitants of the Exiled Lands are lucky enough to sleep in a bed at night. Some disdain the comfort of a full bed, imagining that the softness of the mattress will cause a softening of their bodies and minds.\nBut some see the bed as a place of lovemaking, sleeping and dreaming. They consider it an important part of civilization and sneer at those who sleep on the ground as uncouth savages.\nWhen somebody dies in the Exiled Lands, they awaken in the last place that they slept, unaware of how or why they got there. Using a bed will set it as your spawn point."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Few of the inhabitants of the Exiled Lands are lucky enough to sleep in a bed at night. Some disdain the comfort of a full bed, imagining that the softness of the mattress will cause a softening of their bodies and minds.\nBut some see the bed as a place of lovemaking, sleeping and dreaming. They consider it an important part of civilization and sneer at those who sleep on the ground as uncouth savages.\nWhen somebody dies in the Exiled Lands, they awaken in the last place that they slept, unaware of how or why they got there. Using a bed will set it as your spawn point."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780787_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bunk Bed"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ancient Civ Bunk Bed"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780852_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bunk bed, a space saver for sure"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A bunk bed, a space saver for sure"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780852_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Few of the inhabitants of the Exiled Lands are lucky enough to sleep in a bed at night. Some disdain the comfort of a full bed, imagining that the softness of the mattress will cause a softening of their bodies and minds.\nBut some see the bed as a place of lovemaking, sleeping and dreaming. They consider it an important part of civilization and sneer at those who sleep on the ground as uncouth savages.\nWhen somebody dies in the Exiled Lands, they awaken in the last place that they slept, unaware of how or why they got there. Using a bed will set it as your spawn point."
   },
