  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cub Bear Wall Pelt"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Cub Bear Wall Pelt"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A patterned tapestry in earthen colors"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A patterned tapestry in earthen colors"
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tapestries such as this travel the Lotus road between Khitai and the Kingdoms of the West daily. Woven of plant fibers or silk, they vary in quality and quantity based entirely on the skill of the weaver and the materials used. \nThat these can be made in the Exiled Lands, without a loom, is impressive."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Tapestries such as this travel the Lotus road between Khitai and the Kingdoms of the West daily. Woven of plant fibers or silk, they vary in quality and quantity based entirely on the skill of the weaver and the materials used. \nThat these can be made in the Exiled Lands, without a loom, is impressive."
   },
   "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780868_LongDesc"
  },
  {
