  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "There is a chance that a baby is born every 90 minutes adjusted for server settings "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "There is a chance that a baby is born every 90 minutes adjusted for server settings "
   },
   "Key": "BFF2B4A440239E1F7F43A9AE5EA282A9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Breeding Corral operation\n1. Select the type of young you want to produce from the drop-down menu. \n2. Select parents. The station will search up to eleven foundations from its center point for potential parents. Since Funcom doesn’t have a male and female version of every pet you just need two of the same type. They can be greater or lesser versions but a wolf needs another wolf not an aardwolf.   \n3. Make sure the parents have food from their diet in their inventory\n4. Turn on breeding\n5. Wait for babies\n\nParents stop producing offspring when there are 4 young in the corral."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Breeding Corral operation\n1. Select the type of young you want to produce from the drop-down menu. \n2. Select parents. The station will search up to eleven foundations from its center point for potential parents. Since Funcom doesn’t have a male and female version of every pet you just need two of the same type. They can be greater or lesser versions but a wolf needs another wolf not an aardwolf.   \n3. Make sure the parents have food from their diet in their inventory\n4. Turn on breeding\n5. Wait for babies\n\nParents stop producing offspring when there are 4 young in the corral."
   },
   "Key": "22FA4BB8420BD1E54B321089B3ECF66A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Press Info Button again to Close. "
   },
   "Translation": {
