    "Text": "Tavern Entertainment"
   },
   "Key": "609974DF46B45E06FC35CE9965679CA9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tavern Entertainer"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Tavern Entertainer"
   },
   "Key": "19672E3A41AF32417E9321942D0CC1AF"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A lively spectacle that transforms the tavern into a stage of merriment and joy. From spirited songs and enchanting dances to comedic acts and storytelling, tavern entertainment brings together weary travelers and locals alike. As entertainer thralls take the stage, their performances weave a tapestry of laughter and camaraderie, turning ordinary nights into unforgettable gatherings in the heart of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A lively spectacle that transforms the tavern into a stage of merriment and joy. From spirited songs and enchanting dances to comedic acts and storytelling, tavern entertainment brings together weary travelers and locals alike. As entertainer thralls take the stage, their performances weave a tapestry of laughter and camaraderie, turning ordinary nights into unforgettable gatherings in the heart of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "E9639F30452012E675A01394DD8C623B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Adherent"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Adherent"
   },
   "Key": "3A71892441875A503869BABFD40FDB97"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Religious adherents are individuals who identify with and follow a particular religion, its beliefs, and practices. "
   },
   "Translation": {
