  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Desert Berries"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Desert Berries"
   },
   "Key": "DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Small, blue berries"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Small, blue berries"
   },
   "Key": "DT_HortiMergeItems_18006_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Growing in the dry wastes of the desert, these berries are used in the making of juice and wine. They can be eaten, though they do not offer much nourishment. Still, any sustenance is precious out in the desolate lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Growing in the dry wastes of the desert, these berries are used in the making of juice and wine. They can be eaten, though they do not offer much nourishment. Still, any sustenance is precious out in the desolate lands."
