   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210127_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A rough-hewn tub fashioned from sturdy timber"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A rough-hewn tub fashioned from sturdy timber"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210127_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This crude wooden tub is a simple yet practical addition to any home in the Exiled Lands. While it may lack the elegance of finer designs, it provides a place to wash away dirt and grime after a long day of adventuring. Though humble, this tub offers a sense of comfort and routine in the midst of chaos, reminding you of the small pleasures in life."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This crude wooden tub is a simple yet practical addition to any home in the Exiled Lands. While it may lack the elegance of finer designs, it provides a place to wash away dirt and grime after a long day of adventuring. Though humble, this tub offers a sense of comfort and routine in the midst of chaos, reminding you of the small pleasures in life."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210127_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stygian Nobel Bath"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Stygian Nobel Bath"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210128_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A tub for a nobel crafted from exquisite marble in the Stygian fashion."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A tub for a nobel crafted from exquisite marble in the Stygian fashion."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210128_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This magnificent bath tub, is a testament to luxury and refinement. The smooth, cool surface gleams in the light, its intricate patterns telling tales of ancient craftsmanship and the mystique of the Stygian lands. Designed for those who seek indulgence, this spacious tub invites you to immerse yourself in warmth and serenity, washing away the rigors of your adventures. Marble baths are been favored by the elite, symbolizing both opulence and relaxation. As you recline in its depths, allow the soothing waters to transport you to a realm of tranquility, far removed from the harsh realities of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This magnificent bath tub, is a testament to luxury and refinement. The smooth, cool surface gleams in the light, its intricate patterns telling tales of ancient craftsmanship and the mystique of the Stygian lands. Designed for those who seek indulgence, this spacious tub invites you to immerse yourself in warmth and serenity, washing away the rigors of your adventures. Marble baths are been favored by the elite, symbolizing both opulence and relaxation. As you recline in its depths, allow the soothing waters to transport you to a realm of tranquility, far removed from the harsh realities of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210128_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Aquilonian Royal Bath"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Aquilonian Royal Bath"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210129_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A tub fit for Aquilonian Kings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A tub fit for Aquilonian Kings"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210129_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This exquisite bath tub, crafted from a stunning blend of black and white marble, epitomizes the elegance of Aquilonian craftsmanship. Its polished surfaces reflect light in a mesmerizing dance, showcasing intricate designs that pay homage to the rich history of the Aquilonian nobility. This opulent bath serves as a gathering place for the elite, offering a luxurious retreat where politics and leisure intertwine. As you immerse yourself in the warm waters, allow the soothing embrace of marble to wash away the burdens of leadership and adventure, inviting tranquility and camaraderie among those in you"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This exquisite bath tub, crafted from a stunning blend of black and white marble, epitomizes the elegance of Aquilonian craftsmanship. Its polished surfaces reflect light in a mesmerizing dance, showcasing intricate designs that pay homage to the rich history of the Aquilonian nobility. This opulent bath serves as a gathering place for the elite, offering a luxurious retreat where politics and leisure intertwine. As you immerse yourself in the warm waters, allow the soothing embrace of marble to wash away the burdens of leadership and adventure, inviting tranquility and camaraderie among those in you"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210129_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Herbalist Notes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Herbalist Notes"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210130_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hand scrawled note about local herbs"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Hand scrawled note about local herbs"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210130_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Herbs have a variety of uses including culinary, medicinal, and in some cases, spiritual. General usage of the term \"herb\" differs between culinary herbs and medicinal herbs; in medicinal or spiritual use, any parts of the plant might be considered as \"herbs\", including leaves, roots, flowers, seeds, root bark, inner bark (and cambium), resin and pericarp."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Herbs have a variety of uses including culinary, medicinal, and in some cases, spiritual. General usage of the term \"herb\" differs between culinary herbs and medicinal herbs; in medicinal or spiritual use, any parts of the plant might be considered as \"herbs\", including leaves, roots, flowers, seeds, root bark, inner bark (and cambium), resin and pericarp."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210130_LongDesc"
  },
