  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Lute"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Lute"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210221_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A delicate instrument in a world of savagery. The lute brings melodies to soothe the soul."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A delicate instrument in a world of savagery. The lute brings melodies to soothe the soul."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210221_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Resting on the stage, this well-worn lute awaits the hands of a skilled entertainer thrall. Its carved wood and taut strings echo with the melodies of faraway lands and forgotten times. When played, its soothing or spirited tunes can lift morale and charm even the fiercest of warriors."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Resting on the stage, this well-worn lute awaits the hands of a skilled entertainer thrall. Its carved wood and taut strings echo with the melodies of faraway lands and forgotten times. When played, its soothing or spirited tunes can lift morale and charm even the fiercest of warriors."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210221_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Fiddle"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Fiddle"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210222_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An instrument of both joy and sorrow, the fiddle's high-pitched tunes cut through the silence of the wilderness."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An instrument of both joy and sorrow, the fiddle's high-pitched tunes cut through the silence of the wilderness."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210222_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Set upon the stage, this finely crafted fiddle is ready to sing under the touch of a skilled thrall. Its strings hum with the potential for vibrant jigs or mournful ballads. Whether in the halls of kings or by the campfires of the exiled, the music of this fiddle can captivate and inspire all who hear it."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Set upon the stage, this finely crafted fiddle is ready to sing under the touch of a skilled thrall. Its strings hum with the potential for vibrant jigs or mournful ballads. Whether in the halls of kings or by the campfires of the exiled, the music of this fiddle can captivate and inspire all who hear it."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210222_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Horn"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Horn"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210223_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A horn unleashes deep, resonant tones that carry across the Exiled Lands. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A horn unleashes deep, resonant tones that carry across the Exiled Lands. "
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210223_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Resting prominently on the stage, this horn waits for the breath of a skilled entertainer thrall to unleash its mighty sound. Carved from the tusk of a great beast, its thunderous tones can rouse warriors to battle or signal victory in grand feasts. A single blast from this instrument commands respect across the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Resting prominently on the stage, this horn waits for the breath of a skilled entertainer thrall to unleash its mighty sound. Carved from the tusk of a great beast, its thunderous tones can rouse warriors to battle or signal victory in grand feasts. A single blast from this instrument commands respect across the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210223_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Song"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Entertainer's Song"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210224_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "When performed by a skilled entertainer, a song can enchant listeners, recounting tales of forgotten heroes, tragic love, or triumphant conquests."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "When performed by a skilled entertainer, a song can enchant listeners, recounting tales of forgotten heroes, tragic love, or triumphant conquests."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210224_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The spot where a skilled entertainer thrall can sing. From ballads of lost kingdoms to war chants that inspire armies, the stand amplifies their voice, filling halls or battlefields with songs that stir emotions and strengthen resolve in the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The spot where a skilled entertainer thrall can sing. From ballads of lost kingdoms to war chants that inspire armies, the stand amplifies their voice, filling halls or battlefields with songs that stir emotions and strengthen resolve in the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210224_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tavern Serving Station"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Tavern Serving Station"
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210225_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The section of the bar where the Barkeep keeps vigile."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The section of the bar where the Barkeep keeps vigile."
   },
   "Key": "Core_ItemTable_210225_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A tavern is a type of business where people gather to drink alcoholic beverages and be served food such as different types of roast meats and cheese, and where travelers could receive lodging."
