  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Habitat"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Habitat"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A habitat for Khitan silkworms"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A habitat for Khitan silkworms"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Unique Habitat. The silkworm is a very specialized feeder. It eats only the Grey-Flower Lupine bushes. Because the silkworm has become domesticated so that its cocoons can be harvested to make silk fabric, it no longer lives in the wild, but depends on man-made habitats to survive."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Unique Habitat. The silkworm is a very specialized feeder. It eats only the Grey-Flower Lupine bushes. Because the silkworm has become domesticated so that its cocoons can be harvested to make silk fabric, it no longer lives in the wild, but depends on man-made habitats to survive."
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Box Of Khitan Silkworms"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Box Of Khitan Silkworms"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A box of enough living caterpillars to start a habitat."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A box of enough living caterpillars to start a habitat."
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Somehow a Khitan Silk trader must have found his way into the exiled lands. Judging by the blood stains on the box and journal, the author won't mind if you borrow his notes and try your hand at silk farming."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Somehow a Khitan Silk trader must have found his way into the exiled lands. Judging by the blood stains on the box and journal, the author won't mind if you borrow his notes and try your hand at silk farming."
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Curious Sack"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Curious Sack"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102105_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This sack has a few blood stains on it. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This sack has a few blood stains on it. "
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102105_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sericulture Field Manual"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sericulture Field Manual"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The notes of an unknown exile on how to feed and care for silkworms to produce silk"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The notes of an unknown exile on how to feed and care for silkworms to produce silk"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The journal outlines the steps for producing silk using Khitanese silkworms:\r\n\r\n1) Obtain silkworms and build a silkworm habitat\r\n2) Supply the habitat with Grey-flower Lupine\r\n3) Collect cocoons from the habitat\r\n4) Boil the cocoons at a stove\r\n4) Collect the raw silk\r\n5) Refine the silk into cloth at an Armorer's Bench\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Sericulture feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The journal outlines the steps for producing silk using Khitanese silkworms:\r\n\r\n1) Obtain silkworms and build a silkworm habitat\r\n2) Supply the habitat with Grey-flower Lupine\r\n3) Collect cocoons from the habitat\r\n4) Boil the cocoons at a stove\r\n4) Collect the raw silk\r\n5) Refine the silk into cloth at an Armorer's Bench\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Sericulture feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Cocoon"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Cocoon"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The silkworm completely encloses itself in a cocoon"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The silkworm completely encloses itself in a cocoon"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Boiling the Cocoon will soften it so it will be ready to be woven into silk"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Boiling the Cocoon will soften it so it will be ready to be woven into silk"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grape Seeds"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Grape Seeds"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102109_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The seeds of grapes, a fruit not native to these Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The seeds of grapes, a fruit not native to these Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102109_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grapes"
   },
   "Translation": {
