   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102110_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ingredient"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102110_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grape Pulp"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Grape Pulp"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Redish, purple pulp"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Redish, purple pulp"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The grapes themselves, once cleaned and pruned of excess foliage, may be squeezed in a fluid press in order to produce pulp. While this pulp can certainly be drunk, its true value is in wine-making, where it far surpasses berries in both the quality of texture and flavor.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The grapes themselves, once cleaned and pruned of excess foliage, may be squeezed in a fluid press in order to produce pulp. While this pulp can certainly be drunk, its true value is in wine-making, where it far surpasses berries in both the quality of texture and flavor.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Consumable"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Consumable"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grape Juice"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Grape Juice"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sweet drink made from grapes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sweet drink made from grapes"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This drink, made from squeezed grapes, is sweet to the taste and lightly cools the parched tongue."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This drink, made from squeezed grapes, is sweet to the taste and lightly cools the parched tongue."
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Low Grade"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Consumable"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Consumable"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Vintner's Journal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Vintner's Journal"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The writings of an exile named Gregor Finnacus, detailing methods and best practices for growing grapes and ivy in the Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The writings of an exile named Gregor Finnacus, detailing methods and best practices for growing grapes and ivy in the Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">I know not for what reason I have been cast out of Tarantia, but it seems clear now that I will never leave this place. Wherever this place is.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">There are others here, but even from a distance I have glimpsed their savagery, so for now, I am alone. I have managed to outsmart starvation thus far and keep from the notice of marauding bands of Exiles. I think I will begin my work anew, here in this gods-forsaken place, and record my thoughts in this journal.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">It is not the last, great writing that I had in mind for myself. But I suppose we are not guaranteed what we want in life. Only that we will live, for a time.</>\r\n\r\n- From the Journal of Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Wine Maker feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">I know not for what reason I have been cast out of Tarantia, but it seems clear now that I will never leave this place. Wherever this place is.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">There are others here, but even from a distance I have glimpsed their savagery, so for now, I am alone. I have managed to outsmart starvation thus far and keep from the notice of marauding bands of Exiles. I think I will begin my work anew, here in this gods-forsaken place, and record my thoughts in this journal.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">It is not the last, great writing that I had in mind for myself. But I suppose we are not guaranteed what we want in life. Only that we will live, for a time.</>\r\n\r\n- From the Journal of Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Wine Maker feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Leather Wrapped Book"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Leather Wrapped Book"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102114_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Leather wrapped journal with a small pouch of seeds"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Leather wrapped journal with a small pouch of seeds"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102114_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The seeds for such specimens as I have managed to make flourish here, I will secure in the pages of this book. In the hopes that they will survive, if I do not.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The seeds for such specimens as I have managed to make flourish here, I will secure in the pages of this book. In the hopes that they will survive, if I do not.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102114_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Trellis"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Trellis"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Latticework used as a support for climbing plants"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Latticework used as a support for climbing plants"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The trellis, though a simple feat of carpentry, makes for the ideal growing space for ivy. Allowing them to grasp sustenance from the earth, it then gives them an upward surface upon which to reach for the sun's rays.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The trellis, though a simple feat of carpentry, makes for the ideal growing space for ivy. Allowing them to grasp sustenance from the earth, it then gives them an upward surface upon which to reach for the sun's rays.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Water Barrel"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Water Barrel"
   },
   "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102128_Name"
  },
  {
