  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Zebra Horse Mount"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Zebra Horse Mount"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490023_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An exotic mount for traversing the harsh Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An exotic mount for traversing the harsh Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490023_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A properly bred horse can mean the difference between life and death. This, however, is a zebra. In the Exiled Lands, horses can be used as pack animals, mounts for combat or for quickly traversing the dangers of the harsh lands."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A properly bred horse can mean the difference between life and death. This, however, is a zebra. In the Exiled Lands, horses can be used as pack animals, mounts for combat or for quickly traversing the dangers of the harsh lands."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490023_LongDesc"
  },
