  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Vilewolves were an infamous group of killers, determined to strengthen their own ranks by dominating outsiders and enslaving their strongest warriors. It is said that their conquest was so great, that after successfully taking over most of the world, they began to turn on eachother and eventually destroyed themselves."
   },
