   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490782_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Glowing Goop is a naturally occuring light within the Exiled Lands and regions beyond, and up until now nobody had the brilliant idea to put a bunch of it in a glass bottle to create an on-the-go light source. Look at you, you little pioneer!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Glowing Goop is a naturally occuring light within the Exiled Lands and regions beyond, and up until now nobody had the brilliant idea to put a bunch of it in a glass bottle to create an on-the-go light source. Look at you, you little pioneer!"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490782_LongDesc"
