  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A massive two handed relic sword imbued with violent spirits"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A massive two handed relic sword imbued with violent spirits"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490818_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "When using your offhand attack, instead of a strong overhead, you will perform an overhead that unleashes a powerful AoE effect infront of you that deals damage. Deals increased damage if landing both the weapon strike and the AoE effect. Gain +300 armor for 5 seconds when dealing damage."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "When using your offhand attack, instead of a strong overhead, you will perform an overhead that unleashes a powerful AoE effect infront of you that deals damage. Deals increased damage if landing both the weapon strike and the AoE effect. Gain +300 armor for 5 seconds when dealing damage."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490818_LongDesc"
