   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491063_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Light armor with offense enhancing properties"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Light armor with offense enhancing properties"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491063_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While most forged and crafted armor exists in an effort to dampen or even stop blows, light armor prides itself on doing neither - instead, it allows the wearer to dodge and weave with unhindered agility to avoid strikes entirely."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While most forged and crafted armor exists in an effort to dampen or even stop blows, light armor prides itself on doing neither - instead, it allows the wearer to dodge and weave with unhindered agility to avoid strikes entirely."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491063_LongDesc"
  },
