    "Text": "Heavy armor forged from lighter materials that enhances defensive properties"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491073_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Vile armor is rumored to be one of the strongest and most durable armors in all of the lands, worn only by those with the strength to wear it. Unfortunately, it's origns are not so humble - while it is quality wear, it was forged at the hands of talented slaves taken by the VIlewolves in their conquest."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Vile armor is rumored to be one of the strongest and most durable armors in all of the lands, worn only by those with the strength to wear it. Unfortunately, it's origns are not so humble - while it is quality wear, it was forged at the hands of talented slaves taken by the VIlewolves in their conquest."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491073_LongDesc"
