  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Magic heavy armor of old Vanir design, imbued with Resistant"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Magic heavy armor of old Vanir design, imbued with Resistant"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491090_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While armor for a Vanir strays from tradition, this ceremonial piece was originally forged by a jarl of old who wasn't so foolish as to risk his legacy from a stray arrow or passing blade. Preserved through the generations, this armor ended up in the hands of someone new, who bettered it further still. The wearer can still feel the unerring stubbornness of that Vanir bloodline's refusal to give up."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While armor for a Vanir strays from tradition, this ceremonial piece was originally forged by a jarl of old who wasn't so foolish as to risk his legacy from a stray arrow or passing blade. Preserved through the generations, this armor ended up in the hands of someone new, who bettered it further still. The wearer can still feel the unerring stubbornness of that Vanir bloodline's refusal to give up."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491090_LongDesc"
  },
