  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A staff that lets its wielder channel combustion-based magic"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A staff that lets its wielder channel combustion-based magic"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491116_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491116_LongDesc"
