  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Heavy armor that enhances offensive capabilities"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Heavy armor that enhances offensive capabilities"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491119_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In times of war, the bodies and minds of enemies must be broken entirely. Then, and only then, can victory be declared. This armor was designed to protect just as much as it was to scare the enemies that would face it down."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "In times of war, the bodies and minds of enemies must be broken entirely. Then, and only then, can victory be declared. This armor was designed to protect just as much as it was to scare the enemies that would face it down."
   },
