  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wielded by the brave, strong, and bold alike, the javelin is a weapon of many. This javelin incorporates a unique fighting style that relies on keeping the weapon in hand rather than throwing it. Cleansing effects will remove any poison effects you're suffering from every time the weapon is equipped."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Wielded by the brave, strong, and bold alike, the javelin is a weapon of many. This javelin incorporates a unique fighting style that relies on keeping the weapon in hand rather than throwing it. Cleansing effects will remove any poison effects you're suffering from every time the weapon is equipped."
   },
