   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491712_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythical material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A mythical material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491712_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a dangerous amount of power, so much so that it almost hurts to hold."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a dangerous amount of power, so much so that it almost hurts to hold."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491712_LongDesc"
  },
