  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Two handed relic katana imbued with Charged Finishers & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Two handed relic katana imbued with Charged Finishers & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491734_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tempered in the stormforge, a place eternally trapped in the heart of a raging tempest. This blade thrums with unrelenting power; energizing the wielder, and discharging its unstable kinetics to those unfortunate enough to meet its edge. Commission item."
   },
   "Translation": {
