  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Martyr's Warspear"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Martyr's Warspear"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491736_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Hellfire & Empowering Health"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed sweeping warspear imbued with Hellfire & Empowering Health"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491736_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Spear of the Martyr is a legendary warspear, modeled after the weapon of Esmein's revered hero. Crafted from rare, golden-hued metal, the spear's shaft is both strong and flexible, adorned with intricate engravings depicting the Martyr's sacrifice and Esmein's founding. The double-edged leaf-shaped spearhead is razor-sharp and perfectly balanced, etched with ancient runes for divine strength. An ornate golden guard at the base, shaped like outstretched wings, symbolizes the Martyr's protection. Beyond its function as a weapon, the Spear of the Martyr is a relic of profound spiritual significance, carried by Esmein's highest-ranking warrior-priests in battle, ceremonies, and festivals. To wield it is to bear the weight of the nation's ideals and the legacy of its hero. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The Spear of the Martyr is a legendary warspear, modeled after the weapon of Esmein's revered hero. Crafted from rare, golden-hued metal, the spear's shaft is both strong and flexible, adorned with intricate engravings depicting the Martyr's sacrifice and Esmein's founding. The double-edged leaf-shaped spearhead is razor-sharp and perfectly balanced, etched with ancient runes for divine strength. An ornate golden guard at the base, shaped like outstretched wings, symbolizes the Martyr's protection. Beyond its function as a weapon, the Spear of the Martyr is a relic of profound spiritual significance, carried by Esmein's highest-ranking warrior-priests in battle, ceremonies, and festivals. To wield it is to bear the weight of the nation's ideals and the legacy of its hero. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491736_LongDesc"
