  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dawning Light Halberd"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Dawning Light Halberd"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491737_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed halberd imbued with Empowering Assault and Withering"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed halberd imbued with Empowering Assault and Withering"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491737_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Forged in the sacred fires of the Holy See's ancient forges, the Halberd of the Dawning Light is a masterwork weapon imbued with divine power. Crafted from the finest mythril mined from the northern mountains, its gleaming blade and spike reflect the radiant light of Aeloria, the goddess of celestial bodies. The shaft, made from the heartwood of the ancient oaks of Assam’s Groves, is Coated in Mythril and then engraved with intricate runes and symbols of the Luminary Order, each one a prayer for strength, wisdom, and protection. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Forged in the sacred fires of the Holy See's ancient forges, the Halberd of the Dawning Light is a masterwork weapon imbued with divine power. Crafted from the finest mythril mined from the northern mountains, its gleaming blade and spike reflect the radiant light of Aeloria, the goddess of celestial bodies. The shaft, made from the heartwood of the ancient oaks of Assam’s Groves, is Coated in Mythril and then engraved with intricate runes and symbols of the Luminary Order, each one a prayer for strength, wisdom, and protection. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491737_LongDesc"
