  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rimebreaker Battleaxe"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Rimebreaker Battleaxe"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491739_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491739_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The greataxe stands tall and formidable. Its sturdy, dark wooden shaft features intricate carvings of ancient runes and intertwining vines, inspired by the northern wildlands' rich culture. The shaft is capped with a polished, silvery metal guard, engraved with delicate filigree depicting mythical battles and legendary heroes from northmen lore. The most striking feature is its bardiche-style axe head. The broad, slightly curved blade, is forged from a dark metal that absorbs light. Its razor-sharp edge cleaves through armor and flesh with ease, while jagged spikes on the back add a secondary function of piercing or hooking opponents. Exuding power and craftsmanship, the greataxe embodies the fierce spirit of the northmen, making it a relic of the northern wildlands. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The greataxe stands tall and formidable. Its sturdy, dark wooden shaft features intricate carvings of ancient runes and intertwining vines, inspired by the northern wildlands' rich culture. The shaft is capped with a polished, silvery metal guard, engraved with delicate filigree depicting mythical battles and legendary heroes from northmen lore. The most striking feature is its bardiche-style axe head. The broad, slightly curved blade, is forged from a dark metal that absorbs light. Its razor-sharp edge cleaves through armor and flesh with ease, while jagged spikes on the back add a secondary function of piercing or hooking opponents. Exuding power and craftsmanship, the greataxe embodies the fierce spirit of the northmen, making it a relic of the northern wildlands. Commissioned by Mythic RP."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491739_LongDesc"
