  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Hellfire & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Hellfire & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491753_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A sleek blade with no discernable features. Old legends state that these blades were merely a mass-produced prototype for the Archeron's Rune Knights. The quality of the \"prototype\" speaks volumes in regards to the strength of the Archeron's armies. Commissioned by Kaidus."
   },
