  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Little Liaru Rabbit Pet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Little Liaru Rabbit Pet"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491770_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A dressed up rabbit that will cuddle with you"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A dressed up rabbit that will cuddle with you"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491770_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The wealth of Hyborian nations is built upon the backs of their beasts of burden and those who know how to handle an animal. And the mark of a man can be weighed by the manner in which he treats the least of his animals. Feed them and give them a place to live and they can be the greatest allies in the world. Neglect them and reap the consequences."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The wealth of Hyborian nations is built upon the backs of their beasts of burden and those who know how to handle an animal. And the mark of a man can be weighed by the manner in which he treats the least of his animals. Feed them and give them a place to live and they can be the greatest allies in the world. Neglect them and reap the consequences."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491770_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Pet"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Pet"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491770_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bundled Explosive Jars"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Bundled Explosive Jars"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491771_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Many reinforced ceramic vases, loaded with explosive powder"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Many reinforced ceramic vases, loaded with explosive powder"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491771_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Explosives have become a staple in the destruction of man's grand architecture - and these jars have proven time and time again a key component in transporting the volatile powder contained within. Deals significantly more damage than a regular Explosive Jar, but has a shorter placement range and can only be detonated by interacting with the fuse or another explosion."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Explosives have become a staple in the destruction of man's grand architecture - and these jars have proven time and time again a key component in transporting the volatile powder contained within. Deals significantly more damage than a regular Explosive Jar, but has a shorter placement range and can only be detonated by interacting with the fuse or another explosion."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491771_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Salvation Lifestaff"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Salvation Lifestaff"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491772_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A staff that lets its wielder channel healing & buffing magics"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A staff that lets its wielder channel healing & buffing magics"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491772_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In ordinary hands, an arcane staff is a commonplace length of wood with little to distinguish it beyond its capacity for blunt force trauma. But in the hands of an adept sorcerer, this same length of wood becomes a powerful focus object capable of channeling raw magic into complex spells and invocations. Commissioned by Salvari."
   },
