  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Withering & Empowering Assault"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Withering & Empowering Assault"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491781_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Another blade supposedly created by or in homage to a Long Lost Civilization. Made from an alien crystal-like material, it is rumoured to inflict wounds onto Ghosts, Spirits and other ethereal creatures. Aside from that, it cuts flesh just as good. Commissioned by Baldur."
   },
