   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491793_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Malice Noblesword"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Malice Noblesword"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491794_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Cursed Strikes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Cursed Strikes"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491794_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This legendary sword carries an ancient legend, once wielded by The Herald of Darkness who spread terror among all enemies of his beloved Malak under the blood moon's light. Together, they bent the will of fate, their names etched into history as The Bloody Nightmares. Forged by the shadows, this powerful weapon is a grim reminder of their dark deeds, a heirloom of fear and domination. Commissioned by Nashi."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This legendary sword carries an ancient legend, once wielded by The Herald of Darkness who spread terror among all enemies of his beloved Malak under the blood moon's light. Together, they bent the will of fate, their names etched into history as The Bloody Nightmares. Forged by the shadows, this powerful weapon is a grim reminder of their dark deeds, a heirloom of fear and domination. Commissioned by Nashi."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491794_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
