  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Justice's Edge Longsword"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Justice's Edge Longsword"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491796_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one handed slashing blade, imbued with Empowering Assault & Withering"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A one handed slashing blade, imbued with Empowering Assault & Withering"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491796_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A radiant weapon blessed by Tyr, the god of justice. The blade gleams with a divine light, its surface etched with intricate runes that glow faintly with a silvery-blue hue. The hilt is wrapped in fine, dark leather, adorned with a small, polished emblem of Tyr's scales of justice. When wielded, the sword resonates with a soft, harmonious hum, and its strikes are imbued with the power to vanquish evil and uphold righteousness. Justice's Edge is said to guide its bearer’s hand, ensuring every blow is true and just. Commissioned by Corethan, Paladin of Tyr."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A radiant weapon blessed by Tyr, the god of justice. The blade gleams with a divine light, its surface etched with intricate runes that glow faintly with a silvery-blue hue. The hilt is wrapped in fine, dark leather, adorned with a small, polished emblem of Tyr's scales of justice. When wielded, the sword resonates with a soft, harmonious hum, and its strikes are imbued with the power to vanquish evil and uphold righteousness. Justice's Edge is said to guide its bearer’s hand, ensuring every blow is true and just. Commissioned by Corethan, Paladin of Tyr."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491796_LongDesc"
