    "Text": "\"This Scythe was crafted by Alexander Claude, though just a replica now. It is based on the true Silverfang Scythe which has been lost to time. It carries the Silverfang emblem on its handle and embedded in the steel ashes from his ancestors.\" Commissioned by kingragnar."
