  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A elegant blade wielded by the noble class in more civilized environments. The weight of the weapon lends itself to be an exceptionally controllable tool, so much so that one might confuse dueling for art rather than relentless violence."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A elegant blade wielded by the noble class in more civilized environments. The weight of the weapon lends itself to be an exceptionally controllable tool, so much so that one might confuse dueling for art rather than relentless violence."
