  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This is the blade wielded by the renown warrior Mayumi, it has been enchanted and sharped to a deadly edge. It is said to be made of a unknown metal that makes it far more durable and light. Commissioned by Raya."
   },
   "Translation": {
