   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Heavy Bleed & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491970_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This was the secondary sword of Mayumi, similar in make to her primary Katana. Both blades were almost always worn by her. The Wakizashi was a smaller and more agile blade used for more close quarters and two weapon fighting in rare cases. Commissioned by Raya."
   },
