    "Text": "Scythe of the Hallow"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Scythe of the Hallow"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491991_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed reaper imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed reaper imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491991_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A vile, unholy blade infused with dark magic and stuck crudely atop a shaft of rotted wood, this weapon was made to be wielded only by those who would embrace its darkness. Even simply holding it may cause one to hear whispers, see that which is not truly there. To use it is to give oneself its power, the power to siphon life from those it strikes, to rot the marrow in their bones and plague the flesh beneath their skin. More than a weapon this twisted abomination of a tool is an omen, a promise that the end is near, the only question is for who. Shall you bring ruin to your foes, rot to the living and death to any who dare challenge your might? Or shall you fall completely to the blade, and be nothing more than another foolish soul to sate its endless hunger? Time will tell. Commissioned by Harbinger72."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A vile, unholy blade infused with dark magic and stuck crudely atop a shaft of rotted wood, this weapon was made to be wielded only by those who would embrace its darkness. Even simply holding it may cause one to hear whispers, see that which is not truly there. To use it is to give oneself its power, the power to siphon life from those it strikes, to rot the marrow in their bones and plague the flesh beneath their skin. More than a weapon this twisted abomination of a tool is an omen, a promise that the end is near, the only question is for who. Shall you bring ruin to your foes, rot to the living and death to any who dare challenge your might? Or shall you fall completely to the blade, and be nothing more than another foolish soul to sate its endless hunger? Time will tell. Commissioned by Harbinger72."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491991_LongDesc"
