  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An unholy two-handed reaper, with a hunger for souls"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An unholy two-handed reaper, with a hunger for souls"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492002_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A heretical weapon forged in a cold flame and baptized by the life essence of a devil. Do not be fooled by its regal appearence; for it serves a singular, wretched purpose: The severance of soul from body."
   },
   "Translation": {
