  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A celestial material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A celestial material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492003_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a different kind of power; the fusion of both the natural world and life itself. Trapped forever in a battle of harmony and discord, the raw potential of this object is near unmatched."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a different kind of power; the fusion of both the natural world and life itself. Trapped forever in a battle of harmony and discord, the raw potential of this object is near unmatched."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492003_LongDesc"
