    "Text": "A two-handed katana, marked by the unending Abyss"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492005_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A historic blade, first wielded by one who gazed into the endless Abyss and found a fragment of its power. The unnatural edge passes through skin, bone, and metal as if they were no more than an inconvenice, but the glimpses and whispers of the void that the blade offers threaten to drive even the wisest mad."
   },
