   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Holy Blade of a Paladin of Mitra.  Made in Zingarian style, it is crafted for swift and accurate strikes in combination with footwork and mobility.  The blessings on the blade impart a holy strike to strip away the defenses of the wielder's opponents while simultaniously keeping the wiedler as safe from harm as possbile. Commissioned by Zophar, Paladin of Mitra."
