  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Nera was once an Elven Queen who wanted nothing more than to protect her people. She was a great warrior who didn't just fight she danced mixing magic and sword into a display of grace and deadly accuracy. She tried to gain power through a ritual. The ritual though was corrupted by evil and Nera fell into darkness. Losing her memories and who she once was. Her blades too changed, shrouded now in shadow magic the blades whisper of Nera's lost memories humming a tune of battle. \"Dance with me\" you might hear them say as you wield these swords once lost to time. Commission item."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Nera was once an Elven Queen who wanted nothing more than to protect her people. She was a great warrior who didn't just fight she danced mixing magic and sword into a display of grace and deadly accuracy. She tried to gain power through a ritual. The ritual though was corrupted by evil and Nera fell into darkness. Losing her memories and who she once was. Her blades too changed, shrouded now in shadow magic the blades whisper of Nera's lost memories humming a tune of battle. \"Dance with me\" you might hear them say as you wield these swords once lost to time. Commission item."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492017_LongDesc"
