  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A holy implement, burdening foes with divine retribution"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A holy implement, burdening foes with divine retribution"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492066_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Originally used in service of a great church after the death of their god, this mace was used to send a myriad of abominations and blasphemers back from whence they came. Holding it instills one with a great sense of purpose, as if they alone are the only one capable of saving this broken world. "
   },
