   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A one-handed mace, imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492101_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "With its origins in Maestaria's largest mining colony, this weapon was not used by the indentured to break rock, but by an infamous taskmaster who kept the miners in line. The curse clinging to the sharp flanges kept the miners too weak to resist their merciless despot and often succumbed to infection that spread throughout the ancient tunnels. Inevitably, even its original wielder was claimed by rot. Commission item."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "With its origins in Maestaria's largest mining colony, this weapon was not used by the indentured to break rock, but by an infamous taskmaster who kept the miners in line. The curse clinging to the sharp flanges kept the miners too weak to resist their merciless despot and often succumbed to infection that spread throughout the ancient tunnels. Inevitably, even its original wielder was claimed by rot. Commission item."
   },
