  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A hammer crafted with far more skill and care than one might ordinarily find in the hands of an orc, but one crafted by an orc nonetheless. Despite its size and heft, this hammer is clearly more often used as a blacksmithing hammer, covered in soot, and blackened metal shavings. It is well-balanced, and when the light hits it, flame seems to flicker from within. Commissioned by Victorious."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A hammer crafted with far more skill and care than one might ordinarily find in the hands of an orc, but one crafted by an orc nonetheless. Despite its size and heft, this hammer is clearly more often used as a blacksmithing hammer, covered in soot, and blackened metal shavings. It is well-balanced, and when the light hits it, flame seems to flicker from within. Commissioned by Victorious."
   },
