   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492151_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Decaying Strikes & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492151_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The very name of the Daggers strikes fear into those who know what Vitae is. Many have faced those who wielded these very Daggers and none have lived to tell the tale. Commissioned by Manixx / Revan."
   },
