   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492152_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Withering Strikes & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Withering Strikes & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492152_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "With the silence of a feather falling. These Daggers pose great threat to those injured by it. The rather distasteful toxins that coat the blade are rumored to have threatened the end of entire generations. Commissioned by Manixx / Revan."
   },
   "Translation": {
