    "Text": "Widow's Embrace Daggers"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492153_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492153_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The last memento of the Widow who sought to end any and all who were allied in the murder of her husband. The Daggers each hold a powerful paralytic and rejuvenating poison that was mixed into the very steel of the blades. Are you brave enough to wield these when knowing that death lurks behind every door? Commissioned by Revan."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The last memento of the Widow who sought to end any and all who were allied in the murder of her husband. The Daggers each hold a powerful paralytic and rejuvenating poison that was mixed into the very steel of the blades. Are you brave enough to wield these when knowing that death lurks behind every door? Commissioned by Revan."
   },
