  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A massive, cursed two handed sword imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Decaying Strikes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A massive, cursed two handed sword imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Decaying Strikes"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492162_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While it is a reforged imitation of one of the Warmaker's weapons, there is still no escaping the cost of it's use. Commissioned by JackBright. "
   },
   "Translation": {
