  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Parrinthean Overseer's Ultra Greatsword"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Parrinthean Overseer's Ultra Greatsword"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492172_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A massive, two handed sword imbued with Empowering Assault & Lacerating Strikes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A massive, two handed sword imbued with Empowering Assault & Lacerating Strikes"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492172_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This swords design dates back to the late 3rd age. When Parrinthean was faced with Pirates in the Kaidean gulf. Upon the execution of the pirates leaders atop Parrith’s walls the executioner missed barely with their axe resulting in a sloppy execution. Thus relenting to the design of a much more hefty great sword with no point. With embellished designs on its blade leads it to be almost ceremonial, yet the chance to botch an execution compared to an axe head, was far lower. In present times each member of Parrith’s overseers carry the blade not only for its original use, but to also defend Parrith’s peoples. it’s used often to defend the people, while remaining a stark reminder, of what awaits them should they be found convicted of a heinous enough crime. Commissioned by Parry."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This swords design dates back to the late 3rd age. When Parrinthean was faced with Pirates in the Kaidean gulf. Upon the execution of the pirates leaders atop Parrith’s walls the executioner missed barely with their axe resulting in a sloppy execution. Thus relenting to the design of a much more hefty great sword with no point. With embellished designs on its blade leads it to be almost ceremonial, yet the chance to botch an execution compared to an axe head, was far lower. In present times each member of Parrith’s overseers carry the blade not only for its original use, but to also defend Parrith’s peoples. it’s used often to defend the people, while remaining a stark reminder, of what awaits them should they be found convicted of a heinous enough crime. Commissioned by Parry."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492172_LongDesc"
