  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Offhand blugeoning ward, shaped by the Weaver"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Offhand blugeoning ward, shaped by the Weaver"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492183_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Weaver, responsible for the threads of fate that guide mortal lives, charges her disciples with ensuring that destiny goes unchallenged. This shield is a weapon of one of those guardians, and carries with it her power."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "The Weaver, responsible for the threads of fate that guide mortal lives, charges her disciples with ensuring that destiny goes unchallenged. This shield is a weapon of one of those guardians, and carries with it her power."
