  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed elegant point, forged in perfect balance"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed elegant point, forged in perfect balance"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492184_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A sword of duty and purpose, imbued with magics of light and dark. It is said that this weapon was forged by a group of people being hunted to the last man, with the intention of fighting back against those that would destroy their culture. They held a simple belief that guided them through the darkest of hours: When one falls, we continue. For those who come after."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A sword of duty and purpose, imbued with magics of light and dark. It is said that this weapon was forged by a group of people being hunted to the last man, with the intention of fighting back against those that would destroy their culture. They held a simple belief that guided them through the darkest of hours: When one falls, we continue. For those who come after."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492184_LongDesc"
