   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492230_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one-handed sword, imbued with Berserker's Empower & Godsflame"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A one-handed sword, imbued with Berserker's Empower & Godsflame"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492230_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"A Blade forged by Cimmerian hands of an old Aesir design, most likely forged in the borderlands between Cimmeria and Nordheim.\" Commissioned by Gjallahad."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "\"A Blade forged by Cimmerian hands of an old Aesir design, most likely forged in the borderlands between Cimmeria and Nordheim.\" Commissioned by Gjallahad."
