   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492271_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Plagued Strikes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Plagued Strikes"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492271_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A spear made from tradition, wielded to protect the forest and all beings living in harmony within. This spear was used by the \"Whisper of the Wind\" Chalchuamina. Its said the spear plagues those it strikes, and empowers its wielder against them. Commissioned by Sentique."
   },
