  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Drowned Promises Daggers"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Drowned Promises Daggers"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492273_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Empowering Assault & Decaying Strikes"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Daggers imbued with Empowering Assault & Decaying Strikes"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492273_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Drawn in the lowest abyss beneath the Sea of Whispers, these daggers were forged where light dies and the castoff claw for survival. Their edge still bears grim ancestry, sharp with the memory of forgotten depths. No soul has ever given them up by choice; earned by strength and power. To wield them is to step into an ancient lineage of shadowed crowns and tide-marked doom, claimed by those left forgotten by the world around them. Their strikes hollow courage, their severing blows surge with stolen strength, and the sea itself seems to watch with a promise carved in fate. Commissioned by Abyss."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Drawn in the lowest abyss beneath the Sea of Whispers, these daggers were forged where light dies and the castoff claw for survival. Their edge still bears grim ancestry, sharp with the memory of forgotten depths. No soul has ever given them up by choice; earned by strength and power. To wield them is to step into an ancient lineage of shadowed crowns and tide-marked doom, claimed by those left forgotten by the world around them. Their strikes hollow courage, their severing blows surge with stolen strength, and the sea itself seems to watch with a promise carved in fate. Commissioned by Abyss."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492273_LongDesc"
