   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492280_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sturdy covered armor, imbued with Onslaught"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Sturdy covered armor, imbued with Onslaught"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492280_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A beautiful helm, given to the brother of two siblings as they sought to restore grace to an ever darkening world. Despite the profound dangers, knowing he stood side by side with his blood against this fate made everything simple. To him, no price was too great in order to keep his sister safe."
   },
   "Translation": {
