  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ornate mask, given to the sister of two siblings charged with vanquishing a spreading darkness. While together made every effort to defeat the encroaching night, she quietly held the safety of her brother in an even higher regard; for what is a life without a reason to live it?"
   },
