    "Text": "\"The Meistros were a roaming band of adventurers and mercenaries, that protected the weak and innocent alike. Over the years, their cause and their armor was lost to time. If a new wearer should ever don the new armor, may they be the bulwark against those who would do others harm.\" Commissioned by Shaggymeister."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "\"The Meistros were a roaming band of adventurers and mercenaries, that protected the weak and innocent alike. Over the years, their cause and their armor was lost to time. If a new wearer should ever don the new armor, may they be the bulwark against those who would do others harm.\" Commissioned by Shaggymeister."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492315_LongDesc"
