   "Key": "ItemTable_51009_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While this finely crafted implement functions as an ostentatious display of good fortune, its utility as a tool or weapon is questionable at best."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While this finely crafted implement functions as an ostentatious display of good fortune, its utility as a tool or weapon is questionable at best."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_51009_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ore Mining"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ore Mining"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_51009_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Thrashing Maul"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Thrashing Maul"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ancient weapon"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "An ancient weapon"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Before his coming they had filched steel weapons and armor from the Bossonians and Zingarans, or had hammered out their own crude arms from copper and bronze. Now a new world opened to them, and the clang of sledges re-echoed throughout the land.</> - The Hyborian Age\n\nMauls and warhammers are slow to swing and leave their user vulnerable to counterattack, but when they connect they are brutally effective. Armored foes are particularly vulnerable to these massive blunt weapons which break bones, shatter skulls and crush spines."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Before his coming they had filched steel weapons and armor from the Bossonians and Zingarans, or had hammered out their own crude arms from copper and bronze. Now a new world opened to them, and the clang of sledges re-echoed throughout the land.</> - The Hyborian Age\n\nMauls and warhammers are slow to swing and leave their user vulnerable to counterattack, but when they connect they are brutally effective. Armored foes are particularly vulnerable to these massive blunt weapons which break bones, shatter skulls and crush spines."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "High Grade"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "High Grade"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_24107_FirstModifier"
