  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Corrupting Brew"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Corrupting Brew"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A foreboding liquid of acrid yet sweet aroma"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A foreboding liquid of acrid yet sweet aroma"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Even the arts you call sorcery are governed by cosmic laws.</> - The People of the Black Circle\n\nFoul ingredients are brewed together to make this forbidden drink which corrupts body and soul. Sorcerers covet this libation, for they know that it nourishes a certain, long atrophied organ of the human soul, stimulating it to open like a nocturnal flower and become sensitive to the vibrations and blasphemies of the Outer Dark."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">Even the arts you call sorcery are governed by cosmic laws.</> - The People of the Black Circle\n\nFoul ingredients are brewed together to make this forbidden drink which corrupts body and soul. Sorcerers covet this libation, for they know that it nourishes a certain, long atrophied organ of the human soul, stimulating it to open like a nocturnal flower and become sensitive to the vibrations and blasphemies of the Outer Dark."
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Drink"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Drink"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Corrupting"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Corrupting"
   },
   "Key": "HA_ItemTableOverwrites_18215_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Throwing Axe of Nergal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Throwing Axe of Nergal"
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50561_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A throwing-axe crafted of a dull, grey metal that radiates with intense coldness. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A throwing-axe crafted of a dull, grey metal that radiates with intense coldness. "
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50561_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This weapon traces its origins to a demon-haunted realm of shadow and ice ruled by Nergal, the Father of Bats. Artefacts from this terrible dimension are charged with Nergal's baleful hatred of all living things and radiate with supernatural coldness as a result. \n\nHeld in the off hand, these axes can be used for hacking at enemy shields and, in an emergency, hurled at their faces."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This weapon traces its origins to a demon-haunted realm of shadow and ice ruled by Nergal, the Father of Bats. Artefacts from this terrible dimension are charged with Nergal's baleful hatred of all living things and radiate with supernatural coldness as a result. \n\nHeld in the off hand, these axes can be used for hacking at enemy shields and, in an emergency, hurled at their faces."
   },
   "Key": "ItemTable_50561_LongDesc"
  },
