  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Here you can buy Gems from the Fameshop\n\nYou can equip one gem of each categorie. (A, B, C, D, E)\n\nSome of them are avaible with diffrent Types.\n\nTo see what a Gem would give for Bonus, hover over the Icon.\n\nTo buy a Gem, make sure you have activated the Checkbox, above \nthe Sword Icon in the middle and then \npress on the Gem Icon you want to buy.\n\nGemcost:\nA - 3 Stars\nB - 2 Stars\nC - 2 Stars\nD - 3 Stars\nE - 3 Stars"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Here you can buy Gems from the Fameshop\n\nYou can equip one gem of each categorie. (A, B, C, D, E)\n\nSome of them are avaible with diffrent Types.\n\nTo see what a Gem would give for Bonus, hover over the Icon.\n\nTo buy a Gem, make sure you have activated the Checkbox, above \nthe Sword Icon in the middle and then \npress on the Gem Icon you want to buy.\n\nGemcost:\nA - 3 Stars\nB - 2 Stars\nC - 2 Stars\nD - 3 Stars\nE - 3 Stars"
   },
   "Key": "FA8657374D91A67AA581B4BB8F91193D"
  },
