   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enchant Necklace Precision"
   },
   "Key": "C27F40FF4F183C5BA1EDBA841A306AF2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "[You can scroll here]\nHere you can enchant your EAA Accessories\n\nThey start with [I] means 1 and can go up to [X] means 10.\n\nKeep in mind, on a fail, the whole item will be gone and cant be restored.\n\nThe Enchantment success rate are the following:\n\n+1 -> +2 = 90%\n+2 -> +3 = 80%\n+3 -> +4 = 75%\n+4 -> +5 = 70%\n+5 -> +6 = 60%\n+6 -> +7 = 50%\n+7 -> +8 = 40%\n+8 -> +9 = 30%\n+9 -> +10= 20%\n\nYou need the Upgrade Material and\nthe Accessory\nThen you can press the button.\n\nA short delay will happen, its not worth\nspamming the button.\n\nYou can get the Material and Accessories\nfrom the Vendor.\nAll Accessories which are in your\nInventory will have a chance to get enchanted.\n\nIf you want to keep your Accs safe.\nStore them or wear them.\n"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "[You can scroll here]\nHere you can enchant your EAA Accessories\n\nThey start with [I] means 1 and can go up to [X] means 10.\n\nKeep in mind, on a fail, the whole item will be gone and cant be restored.\n\nThe Enchantment success rate are the following:\n\n+1 -> +2 = 90%\n+2 -> +3 = 80%\n+3 -> +4 = 75%\n+4 -> +5 = 70%\n+5 -> +6 = 60%\n+6 -> +7 = 50%\n+7 -> +8 = 40%\n+8 -> +9 = 30%\n+9 -> +10= 20%\n\nYou need the Upgrade Material and\nthe Accessory\nThen you can press the button.\n\nA short delay will happen, its not worth\nspamming the button.\n\nYou can get the Material and Accessories\nfrom the Vendor.\nAll Accessories which are in your\nInventory will have a chance to get enchanted.\n\nIf you want to keep your Accs safe.\nStore them or wear them.\n"
   },
   "Key": "6A24E48844151247AC6F05AAF1A4BCF0"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enchant Ring Fury"
   },
   "Translation": {
