  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Fish Trap"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Fish Trap"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544333_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544333_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Much of humanity's earliest exercises in cunning and ingenuity came from staring at the water and devising an easier way to catch fish. Traps and nets are woven from various, tough fibers, and aid in man's pursuit of tasty fish."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Much of humanity's earliest exercises in cunning and ingenuity came from staring at the water and devising an easier way to catch fish. Traps and nets are woven from various, tough fibers, and aid in man's pursuit of tasty fish."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544333_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Beehive"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Beehive"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544334_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544334_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Dismantling Bench"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Dismantling Bench"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544335_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544335_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This workbench allows the disassembly of armor, weapons, and building pieces into component parts - at some loss."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This workbench allows the disassembly of armor, weapons, and building pieces into component parts - at some loss."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544335_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Fluid Press"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Fluid Press"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544336_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544336_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This useful device presses and separates liquid from materials - such as oil from raw fish or seeds."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "This useful device presses and separates liquid from materials - such as oil from raw fish or seeds."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544336_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Grinder"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Grinder"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544337_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544337_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "With its circular action, this heavy, stone tool grinds greater masses of substances, more efficiently, than a simple mortar and pestle. It can be used to grind things like salt and spices down to useful granules and powders."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "With its circular action, this heavy, stone tool grinds greater masses of substances, more efficiently, than a simple mortar and pestle. It can be used to grind things like salt and spices down to useful granules and powders."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544337_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Compost Heap"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Compost Heap"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ask not a man what goes into his compost heap. That is his business alone. It is what a man removes from his compost heap that matters."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Ask not a man what goes into his compost heap. That is his business alone. It is what a man removes from his compost heap that matters."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544338_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Planter"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Planter"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544339_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544339_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Shellfish Trap"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Shellfish Trap"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Faster, better, enhanced!"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Much of humanity's earliest exercises in cunning and ingenuity came from staring at the water and devising an easier way to catch fish. Submersible cages made from wooden boards, and sometimes a mesh of metal, are employed in the pursuit of tasty shellfish."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Much of humanity's earliest exercises in cunning and ingenuity came from staring at the water and devising an easier way to catch fish. Submersible cages made from wooden boards, and sometimes a mesh of metal, are employed in the pursuit of tasty shellfish."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544340_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Cage of Pain"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Cage of Pain"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544341_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wheel of Pain without Slavemaster Slot"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Wheel of Pain without Slavemaster Slot"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544341_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Preservation Box"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Preservation Box"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "200 Slots"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "200 Slots"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay. This larger icebox holds more food and preserves it longer."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Though salting and drying are common methods to preserve food, some use containers filled with ice to slow the process of decay. This larger icebox holds more food and preserves it longer."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544342_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Large Chest"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Large Chest"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544343_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "200 Slots"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "200 Slots"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5544343_ShortDesc"
  },
