  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "[Trait Rune (Weapon)] Light Attack Damage"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "[Trait Rune (Weapon)] Light Attack Damage"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Trait Runes are level based modifications. A Weapon, Armor and Tool can store up to 5 Levels - each trait rune increase the level by one. You cant remove the trait runes, once applied. After usage you see a notification which level your item have. Obviously, Armor Value on Weapons, Harvest Damage on Armor or Damage on Armor would make no sense."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Trait Runes are level based modifications. A Weapon, Armor and Tool can store up to 5 Levels - each trait rune increase the level by one. You cant remove the trait runes, once applied. After usage you see a notification which level your item have. Obviously, Armor Value on Weapons, Harvest Damage on Armor or Damage on Armor would make no sense."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_LongDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Armory & Arsenal"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhanced Armory & Arsenal"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_FirstModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Traitrune"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Traitrune"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_SecondModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Enhance your Gear up to Level 5"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Enhance your Gear up to Level 5"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_ThirdModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Weapons/Armors only"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Weapons/Armors only"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545172_FourthModifier"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "[Trait Rune (Weapon)] Heavy Attack Damage"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "[Trait Rune (Weapon)] Heavy Attack Damage"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545173_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Trait Runes are level based modifications. A Weapon, Armor and Tool can store up to 5 Levels - each trait rune increase the level by one. You cant remove the trait runes, once applied. After usage you see a notification which level your item have. Obviously, Armor Value on Weapons, Harvest Damage on Armor or Damage on Armor would make no sense."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Trait Runes are level based modifications. A Weapon, Armor and Tool can store up to 5 Levels - each trait rune increase the level by one. You cant remove the trait runes, once applied. After usage you see a notification which level your item have. Obviously, Armor Value on Weapons, Harvest Damage on Armor or Damage on Armor would make no sense."
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545173_LongDesc"
