  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A well-made sword"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "A well-made sword"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_5545416_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Behold, the mighty Longsword of Valeria, scourge of the seas and terror of the coastlands! Said to be forged in the fiery pits of the devil himself, this blade has tasted the blood of countless victims in its quest for loot and glory. Beware, for in the hands of Valeria, this sword has claimed the lives of many a brave sailor and warriors. It's a powerful weapon, worthy of a true pirate king or queen."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Behold, the mighty Longsword of Valeria, scourge of the seas and terror of the coastlands! Said to be forged in the fiery pits of the devil himself, this blade has tasted the blood of countless victims in its quest for loot and glory. Beware, for in the hands of Valeria, this sword has claimed the lives of many a brave sailor and warriors. It's a powerful weapon, worthy of a true pirate king or queen."
   },
