    "Text": "Yellow Lotus Blossom"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_14151_Name"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Plucked from gently waving lotus blossoms"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Plucked from gently waving lotus blossoms"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_14151_ShortDesc"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While the black lotus is feared for its deadly effect, the yellow lotus is known for its ability to cause visions and hallucinations of great import.\nThose who lose themselves in the lotus dreams can have a difficult path back, but eternal renewal is worth the risk.\n"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "While the black lotus is feared for its deadly effect, the yellow lotus is known for its ability to cause visions and hallucinations of great import.\nThose who lose themselves in the lotus dreams can have a difficult path back, but eternal renewal is worth the risk.\n"
   },
   "Key": "DT_EAA_Itemtable_14151_LongDesc"
