  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Simple Minimap cannot initialize the map marker system\nThis is likely due to having some other, potentially outdated mod or one that modifies the vanilla map UI, causing it to be incompatible with other mods\n\nOnce you solve the conflict, you will be able to place an unlimited amount of custom markers on the map using the custom marker system in Simple Minimap."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Simple Minimap cannot initialize the map marker system\nThis is likely due to having some other, potentially outdated mod or one that modifies the vanilla map UI, causing it to be incompatible with other mods\n\nOnce you solve the conflict, you will be able to place an unlimited amount of custom markers on the map using the custom marker system in Simple Minimap."
   },
   "Key": "F4A2DB3C4B3A11CA60FC87A4608B5B7C"
  },
